{ "Auto exposure: gives the model a white point measured from the frame, for games that\nhand very dark linear colour (KCD2 at night) where the model shows grain or a green\ntint. Off by default.", "自动曝光：给模型一个从画面测得的白点，用于那些传来的线性颜色\n很暗（如夜晚的 KCD2）、导致模型出现颗粒或偏绿的游戏。\n默认关闭。" },
