{ "Before the RX 6000 network runs, the runtime compiles every one of its pipelines\nonce, apart from the game. One of them failed, so NR stays off rather than crash.\nThe verdict is kept for this driver (dlssnr-amd\\rdna2-check.txt); a new driver is\nchecked again. mochizuki_nr.log has the details.", "RX 6000 网络运行之前，运行时会在游戏之外把它的每个 pipeline\n各编译一次。其中一个失败了，所以 NR 保持关闭，以免崩溃。\n结论会按当前驱动保存（dlssnr-amd\\rdna2-check.txt）；\n换新驱动后会重新检查。详情见 mochizuki_nr.log。" },
{ "Before the RX 7000 network runs, the runtime checks how the driver lays out the GPU's\nmatrices and compiles every one of its pipelines once, apart from the game. One of\nthose failed, so NR stays off rather than draw a wrong picture or crash. The verdict\nis kept for this driver (dlssnr-amd\\rdna3-check.txt); a new driver is checked again.\nmochizuki_nr.log has the details.", "RX 7000 网络运行之前，运行时会检查驱动如何排布 GPU 的矩阵，\n并在游戏之外把它的每个 pipeline 各编译一次。其中一项失败了，\n所以 NR 保持关闭，以免画面出错或崩溃。结论会按当前驱动保存\n（dlssnr-amd\\rdna3-check.txt）；换新驱动后会重新检查。\n详情见 mochizuki_nr.log。" },
{ "Before the upscaler", "超分之前" },
{ "Best when can be used, some games are not compatible (e.g. Cyberpunk)\nand will fallback to Aggressive", "能用时效果最好，但部分游戏不兼容（如 Cyberpunk），\n会回退到“激进”" },
{ "Bias Mask Strength", "偏置遮罩强度" },
{ "Bicubic", "Bicubic" },
{ "Black lift", "黑位抬升" },
{ "Black lift: the runtime's own lift of the darkest tones on the curve above, 0 by\ndefault (none).\n\nExposure: the brightness the network sees the frame at. Game uses the exposure\nthe game hands the upscaler, when it does; Auto is the runtime's own estimate,\nwhich puts the frame's mean at the middle of the curve.\n\nBoth are danielblnc's own controls and restart the model's history when\nchanged. Needs the danielblnc runtime 0.4.0 or later.", "黑位抬升：运行时自己在上面的曲线上对最暗色调的抬升，\n默认为 0（无）。\n\n曝光：网络看到的画面亮度。“游戏”使用游戏交给超分的曝光\n（如果它提供的话）；“自动”是运行时自己的估算，\n把画面的平均值放在曲线中点。\n\n两者都是 danielblnc 自己的控件，更改时会重置模型的历史。\n需要 danielblnc 运行时 0.4.0 或更高版本。" },
{ "Blends only the model's change toward the previous frame. The game's own picture reaches\nthe upscaler as it arrived, so its detail stays.", "只把模型的改动向上一帧混合。游戏自己的画面原样送到超分，\n所以细节得以保留。" },
{ "Block rarely used resources from using as HUDless \nto prevent flickers and other issues\n\nHUDfix enable/disable will reset the block list!", "阻止很少使用的资源被当作 HUDless，\n以防止闪烁和其他问题\n\n启用/禁用 HUDfix 会重置屏蔽列表！" },
{ "Blue", "蓝色" },
{ "Blur Strength", "模糊强度" },
{ "Blur the game behind the menu\nOnly visible when Background Alpha is below 1", "模糊菜单后面的游戏画面\n仅在“背景不透明度”低于 1 时可见" },
{ "Border Size", "边框粗细" },
{ "Borderless display mode required!", "需要无边框显示模式！" },
