{ "Bottom left", "左下角" },
{ "Bottom right", "右下角" },
{ "Bounce lighting", "反弹光照" },
{ "Bounce saturation", "反弹光饱和度" },
{ "Bounded ratio", "有界比值" },
{ "Bounds the handover to RR's local distribution, in standard deviations.\nThe handover path is purely spatial, so it filters a fresh noise\nrealization every frame and flickers even on a static scene - no blend\ncan fix that, since a mix inherits the instability of whichever side is\nunstable. RR's output is temporally stable, so clamping to its\nneighbourhood lends that stability without lending its blur: values\nalready inside the range pass untouched.\nLower clamps harder. 0 is off.", "把 handover 限制在 RR 的局部分布范围内，单位为标准差。\nhandover 路径是纯空间的，所以每帧过滤的都是全新的噪声样本，\n即使静止场景也会闪烁 - 混合解决不了这个问题，\n因为混合结果会继承不稳定一方的不稳定性。\nRR 的输出在时域上是稳定的，所以钳制到它的邻域\n能借到这份稳定而不带来它的模糊：\n已在范围内的值原样通过。\n越低钳制越强。0 为关闭。" },
{ "Building the network: NR shows when it is ready. The first build in a\ngame can take a minute; the next ones a few seconds.", "正在构建网络：就绪后 NR 才会显示。游戏中的首次构建\n可能需要一分钟；之后只要几秒。" },
{ "Building the network; frames pass through until it is ready.", "正在构建网络；就绪之前画面会原样通过。" },
