{ "Can be toggled with a key -- bind it under Keybinds, \"Neural Rendering\".", "可以用按键切换 -- 在“按键绑定”的 \"Neural Rendering\" 下绑定。" },
{ "Can be used with any FG Output\n\nRequires enabling DLSS-FG in game settings\nSupports HUDless out of the box\n\nLimited to games that use Streamline", "可搭配任意 FG 输出\n\n需要在游戏设置中开启 DLSS-FG\n原生支持 HUDless\n\n仅限使用 Streamline 的游戏" },
{ "Can be used with any FG Output\n\nRequires enabling FSR-FG in game settings\nSupports HUDless out of the box", "可搭配任意 FG 输出\n\n需要在游戏设置中开启 FSR-FG\n原生支持 HUDless" },
{ "Can be used with any FG Output\n\nRequires enabling XeSS-FG in game settings\nSupports HUDless out of the box", "可搭配任意 FG 输出\n\n需要在游戏设置中开启 XeSS-FG\n原生支持 HUDless" },
{ "Can help with blurry textures in broken games\nNegative values will make textures sharper\nPositive values will make textures more blurry\n\nHas a small performance impact", "对有问题的游戏里纹理模糊的情况有帮助\n负值让纹理更锐利\n正值让纹理更模糊\n\n对性能有少量影响" },
{ "Can't find nvngx.dll and libxess.dll and FSR inputs\nUpscaling support will NOT work.", "找不到 nvngx.dll、libxess.dll 和 FSR 输入\n超分功能将无法工作。" },
