{ "Changes the multiplier on the fly to hit the target FPS,\nup to the Frame Gen setting (at 2X: FG on or off).", "实时调整倍率以达到目标 FPS，\n上限为帧生成的设置（2X 时：FG 开或关）。" },
{ "Changes the picture the network is shown (exposure, display curve, contrast,\nsaturation) and takes every change back out of its answer, so it changes how\nthe network edits the frame, not the frame itself.\n\nAuto exposure helps games that do not hand their exposure to the upscaler\n(a frame that turns green or grainy). The first time it is on the network is\nrebuilt once. Auto or fixed exposure replaces the RenoDX stage's divisor, and a curve its\nencoding curve. mochizuki0323's Preprocess.", "改变给网络看的画面（曝光、显示曲线、对比度、饱和度），\n并把每项改动从它的结果中还原回去，所以改变的是\n网络编辑画面的方式，而不是画面本身。\n\n自动曝光对不把曝光交给超分的游戏有帮助\n（画面发绿或出现颗粒）。首次开启时网络会重建一次。\n自动或固定曝光会取代 RenoDX 阶段的除数，\n曲线则取代它的编码曲线。mochizuki0323 的 Preprocess。" },
{ "Check for Update", "检查更新" },
{ "Checking the RX 6000 network: on a new driver every pipeline is compiled\nonce apart from the game first. Its pipelines are large: this can take\nhalf an hour or more; NR shows when it is ready.", "正在检查 RX 6000 网络：换了新驱动后，每个 pipeline 都要先在\n游戏之外编译一次。它的 pipeline 很大：可能需要\n半小时甚至更久；就绪后 NR 才会显示。" },
{ "Checking the RX 7000 network: on a new driver every pipeline is compiled\nonce apart from the game first. This takes 1 to 2 minutes; NR shows\nwhen it is ready.", "正在检查 RX 7000 网络：换了新驱动后，每个 pipeline 都要先在\n游戏之外编译一次。这需要 1 到 2 分钟；\n就绪后 NR 才会显示。" },
{ "Cinematic", "电影感" },
{ "Clamp Output", "钳制输出" },
{ "Clamp disocclusion mask to 0..1", "将去遮挡遮罩钳制到 0..1" },
{ "Clamps the final image to the [0, 1] range.\n\nPrevents overshoot artifacts such as bright halos or negative colors.\nRecommended for LDR pipelines; optional for HDR depending on tone-mapping.\n\nWhen not set OptiScaler controls it via upscalers HDR flag", "把最终图像钳制到 [0, 1] 范围。\n\n防止过冲伪影，如亮色光晕或负的颜色值。\n推荐用于 LDR 管线；HDR 下可选，取决于色调映射。\n\n未设置时，OptiScaler 根据超分的 HDR 标志来控制" },
{ "Classic", "经典" },
{ "Classifies the converted diffuse lighting for RR 1.2.\nChanging this recreates the denoiser context.\nAuto locks to Indirect when the first validated frame supplies a\ndiffuse ray length; otherwise it locks to Direct, since Indirect\nDiffuse reads that length from its alpha and has nothing to work\nfrom without it.\nThe source is combined lighting, so both explicit choices remain\nexperimental.", "为 RR 1.2 对转换后的漫反射光照进行分类。\n更改此项会重建降噪器上下文。\n当第一个通过验证的帧提供了漫反射光线长度时，\n“自动”会锁定为“间接”；否则锁定为“直接”，\n因为间接漫反射从 alpha 中读取该长度，\n没有它就无从下手。\n来源是合并后的光照，所以两个手动选项都仍属实验性。" },
{ "Classifies the converted specular lighting for RR 1.2.\nChanging this recreates the denoiser context.\nAuto locks to Indirect when the first validated frame has a specular\nhit-distance guide; otherwise it locks to Direct.\nUse this to compare Direct and Indirect handling of mirror reflections.\nIndirect Specular consumes the available specular ray hit distance; Direct ignores it.", "为 RR 1.2 对转换后的镜面反射光照进行分类。\n更改此项会重建降噪器上下文。\n当第一个通过验证的帧带有镜面反射命中距离引导时，\n“自动”会锁定为“间接”；否则锁定为“直接”。\n可用它对比“直接”和“间接”对镜面反射的处理。\n间接镜面反射会使用可用的镜面光线命中距离；“直接”则忽略它。" },
