{ "Controls how much the denoiser blends previous frames with the current frame.\nHigher: Smoother, less noisy image, but may cause ghosting or loss of fine detail.\nLower: More responsive and detailed, but may show noise or a boiling effect.", "控制降噪器把历史帧与当前帧混合的程度。\n调高：画面更平滑、噪点更少，但可能出现鬼影或丢失精细细节。\n调低：响应更快、细节更多，但可能出现噪点或“沸腾”现象。" },
{ "Controls how sensitive the denoiser is to newly revealed areas when objects move.\nLower: More sensitive - better handles moving objects, but may cause flickering.\nHigher: Less sensitive - reduces flickering, but may cause ghosting or light smearing.", "控制物体移动时，降噪器对新露出区域的敏感程度。\n调低：更敏感 - 运动物体处理得更好，但可能引起闪烁。\n调高：不那么敏感 - 减少闪烁，但可能出现鬼影或光照拖影。" },
{ "Controls how strongly sharpening is reduced across depth edges.\n\nHigher values more aggressively prevent sharpening across object boundaries (reduces halos).\nLower values allow more sharpening to pass across edges (sharper but riskier).", "控制锐化在深度边缘处被削弱的强度。\n\n数值越高，越强力地阻止锐化跨越物体边界（减少光晕）。\n数值越低，允许更多锐化跨越边缘（更锐利但风险更大）。" },
{ "Controls how strongly the denoiser preserves edges based on surface angles.\nHigher: Keeps edges sharper and prevents blurring across surface boundaries.\nToo high: May introduce noise or artifacts on complex surfaces.", "控制降噪器根据表面角度保留边缘的强度。\n调高：边缘更锐利，防止跨表面边界的模糊。\n过高：可能在复杂表面上引入噪点或伪影。" },
{ "Controls how the smoothing filter adapts to surface details.\nHigher: Filter stretches more to follow surface geometry, reducing rippling and banding on smooth surfaces.\nLower: Slightly sharper with weaker smoothing on large surfaces, may increase banding and rippling.\n", "控制平滑滤波器如何适应表面细节。\n调高：滤波器更多地沿表面几何拉伸，减少光滑表面上的波纹和色带。\n调低：略微更锐利，大面积表面上的平滑更弱，可能增加色带和波纹。\n" },
{ "Controls sharpness at high contrast areas.", "控制高对比度区域的锐度。" },
{ "Controls the DXGI Present sync interval (the swap interval on\nOpenGL), which determines how the swap chain waits for vertical\nrefresh.\n\n0  = Present immediately, no VSync wait.\n1  = Sync to every refresh, normal VSync.\n2+ = Present every N refreshes, reducing effective frame rate.\n\nHigher values can reduce tearing but may increase latency and cap FPS.\nFor most games, use 0 for lowest latency or 1 for normal VSync.", "控制 DXGI Present 的同步间隔（OpenGL 上为 swap interval），\n它决定交换链如何等待垂直刷新。\n\n0  = 立即呈现，不等待垂直同步。\n1  = 每次刷新都同步，即普通垂直同步。\n2+ = 每 N 次刷新呈现一次，会降低实际帧率。\n\n数值越高越能减少撕裂，但可能增加延迟并限制 FPS。\n大多数游戏用 0 获得最低延迟，或用 1 获得普通垂直同步。" },
{ "Controls tolerance for bright spots relative to their surroundings.\nLower: Aggressively removes fireflies and noise, but may dim small intense light sources.\nHigher: Better preserves specular highlights and glowing surfaces, but allows more noise.", "控制对相对周围偏亮的亮点的容忍度。\n调低：强力去除萤火虫噪点和噪声，但可能让小而强的光源变暗。\n调高：更好地保留镜面高光和发光表面，但会放过更多噪点。" },
{ "Converts depth distances into the units of the camera position\nso the cache can follow the camera when you walk.\n0 = only follow rotation\nWrong values make the cache fill wobble while walking\nAlso used by the 3rd person detection\nUnreal Engine is usually around 1000", "把深度距离换算成相机位置所用的单位，\n这样你走动时缓存才能跟上相机。\n0 = 只跟随旋转\n数值不对会让缓存填充在走动时晃动\n第三人称检测也会用到它\nUnreal Engine 通常在 1000 左右" },
{ "Cope smarter, not harder", "嘴硬要靠技巧，别靠蛮力" },
{ "Coping is strong with this one...", "此人身上的嘴硬之力很强..." },
{ "Correlation Bias", "相关性偏置" },
{ "Corresponds to amount of accumulation added per frame\nat pixel coordinate where disocclusion occured or when\nreactive mask value is > 0.0f. Decreasing this and \ndrawing the ghosting object (IE no mv) to reactive mask \nwith value close to 1.0f can decrease temporal ghosting.\nDecreasing this could result in more thin feature pixels flickering.", "对应在发生去遮挡的像素坐标处、或反应遮罩值 > 0.0f 时，\n每帧增加的累积量。调低此值，并把产生鬼影的物体\n（即没有 mv 的）以接近 1.0f 的值画进反应遮罩，\n可以减轻时域鬼影。\n调低此值可能让更多细小特征的像素闪烁。" },
