{ "D3D12: the network runs on the game's own device, recorded into its command list\n(no second device, no copies through shared memory, no queue crossings).\nVulkan: the network runs on a Vulkan device of its own beside the game.\nAuto: D3D12 when the runtime's check on this GPU and driver passes, otherwise Vulkan.\nChanging it recreates OpenRR.", "D3D12：网络运行在游戏自己的设备上，录入它的命令列表\n（没有第二个设备，没有经共享内存的拷贝，没有跨队列）。\nVulkan：网络运行在游戏旁边一个它自己的 Vulkan 设备上。\n自动：运行时对这块 GPU 和驱动的检查通过时用 D3D12，否则用 Vulkan。\n更改此项会重建 OpenRR。" },
