{ "Each internal FSR4 preset is tuned for a specific resolution.\nSelecting an FSR4 preset won't change the in-game\nupscaler preset!!!\n\nPreset 0 is meant for FSR Native AA\nPreset 1 is meant for Quality/Ultra Quality\nPreset 2 is meant for Balanced\nPreset 3 is meant for Performance\nPreset 4 is meant for DRS\nPreset 5 is meant for Ultra Performance", "每个 FSR4 内部预设都针对特定分辨率调校。\n选择 FSR4 预设不会改变游戏内的\n超分预设！！！\n\nPreset 0 用于 FSR Native AA\nPreset 1 用于质量/超高质量\nPreset 2 用于平衡\nPreset 3 用于性能\nPreset 4 用于 DRS\nPreset 5 用于超级性能" },
{ "Each pass also reads its own result from the previous frame, moved along the game's\nmotion vectors. Keeps the effect steadier in motion, most of all with several passes.\nOff runs every frame on its own.", "每一遍还会读取自己上一帧的结果，并沿游戏的运动矢量移动。\n让效果在运动中更稳定，多遍时尤其明显。\n关闭后每帧独立运行。" },
{ "Each pass has its own style and model strengths. Changes apply when you release a slider.", "每一遍都有自己的风格和模型强度。松开滑块时更改生效。" },
