{ "Expands the cutoff area by this many depth pixels\nUse only when you see an outline left by the cutoff process", "把裁切区域扩大这么多个深度像素\n只在看到裁切过程留下的轮廓时使用" },
{ "Experimental", "实验性" },
{ "Experimental. Finds people in the frame on the CPU, in a process of its own, and with two or more\npasses keeps the first pass's result on them; the rest of the frame takes every pass. With one pass\nonly the strength and detail below act. Needs the person-model folder beside OptiScaler (models\nand ONNX Runtime). Where the mask is missing, late or the game's motion and depth are unusable, the\nframe keeps NR as it is. Off by default.", "实验性。在 CPU 上、在独立的进程中找出画面里的人物；用两遍或更多遍时，\n人物身上保留第一遍的结果，画面其余部分则经过每一遍。只有一遍时，\n只有下面的强度和细节起作用。需要 OptiScaler 旁边有 person-model\n文件夹（模型和 ONNX Runtime）。遮罩缺失、迟到，或游戏的运动和深度\n不可用时，该帧的 NR 保持原样。默认关闭。" },
{ "Exponent on the floor filter's normal edge-stopping weight. Higher\nstops harder at creases and silhouettes; 0.0 disables the term.", "floor 滤波器法线边缘停止权重的指数。越高，\n在折痕和轮廓处停止得越强；0.0 则禁用该项。" },
