{ "Fast mode options", "快速模式选项" },
{ "Fast: cheaper arithmetic where the difference is barely visible, about 13%\nfaster (RX 9000; on other GPUs only the colour conversion changes).\nQuality: NVIDIA's own arithmetic.\n\nNeeds the danielblnc runtime 0.4.2 or later.", "快速：在差别几乎看不出的地方使用更省的运算，约快 13%\n（RX 9000；其他 GPU 上只有颜色转换有变化）。\n质量：NVIDIA 自己的运算。\n\n需要 danielblnc 运行时 0.4.2 或更高版本。" },
{ "Fastest traditional option.\nProduces a very soft/blurry image, but might be okay for downscaling.", "最快的传统选项。\n画面非常柔和/模糊，但用于缩小也许还行。" },
{ "Feedback", "反馈" },
{ "Feeds the game's DLSS.DisocclusionMask to the network, as DLSS-RR does.\nDiagnostic: turn it off to see whether trails or ghosting change.", "像 DLSS-RR 那样，把游戏的 DLSS.DisocclusionMask 送入网络。\n诊断用：关掉它，看拖尾或鬼影是否有变化。" },
{ "Feeds the game's DLSSD.ColorBeforeTransparency to the network, as DLSS-RR does.\nDiagnostic: turn it off to see whether glass, water or particles change.", "像 DLSS-RR 那样，把游戏的 DLSSD.ColorBeforeTransparency 送入网络。\n诊断用：关掉它，看玻璃、水面或粒子是否有变化。" },
{ "Feeds the game's DLSSD.DepthOfFieldGuide to the network, as DLSS-RR does.\nDiagnostic: turn it off to see whether out-of-focus areas change.", "像 DLSS-RR 那样，把游戏的 DLSSD.DepthOfFieldGuide 送入网络。\n诊断用：关掉它，看失焦区域是否有变化。" },
{ "Feeds the game's DLSSD.ResponsivityMask to the network, as DLSS-RR does.\nDiagnostic: turn it off to see whether ghosting or smearing change.", "像 DLSS-RR 那样，把游戏的 DLSSD.ResponsivityMask 送入网络。\n诊断用：关掉它，看鬼影或拖影是否有变化。" },
{ "Feeds the game's subsurface scattering guide (or ColorBeforeFog) to the network, as DLSS-RR does.\nDiagnostic: turn it off to see whether skin or trails change.\nopennr_rr.log gets a summary of what the game puts in the mask and the guide every 3 s.", "像 DLSS-RR 那样，把游戏的次表面散射引导（或 ColorBeforeFog）送入网络。\n诊断用：关掉它，看皮肤或拖尾是否有变化。\nopennr_rr.log 每 3 秒会记录一次游戏在遮罩和引导中所放内容的摘要。" },
