{ "Flip Use Offset", "翻转使用偏移" },
{ "Flip Velocity & Depth resources of Unity games", "翻转 Unity 游戏的 Velocity 和深度资源" },
{ "Flip metering mode applied in the driver\nFSR only requests it in exclusive or borderless fullscreen", "驱动中应用的 flip metering 模式\nFSR 只在独占全屏或无边框全屏下请求它" },
{ "Flip this if the picture gets worse in the direction it should be\ngetting better. Most engines store an exposure that falls as\nthe scene brightens; some store its reciprocal, and a buffer\nfound by shape does not say which. Add a second anchor point in\ndifferent light and this is decided for you, so it disappears.", "如果画面在本该变好的方向上反而变差，就翻转这一项。\n多数引擎存的曝光值随场景变亮而下降；有些存的是它的倒数，\n而按形状找到的缓冲区并不说明是哪一种。\n在不同光照下再加一个锚点，就会自动替你判定，\n这个选项也就消失了。" },
