{ "Frames shown per rendered frame\n\nAuto is 3X, or 2X when the XeFG provider allows no MFG.\nAbove 4X the generated frames come faster than the display\nrefreshes, so VSync or a frame rate cap is needed.", "每个渲染帧对应显示的帧数\n\n“自动”为 3X；XeFG 提供方不允许 MFG 时为 2X。\n超过 4X 时，生成帧的速度会快过显示器刷新，\n所以需要垂直同步或帧率上限。" },
{ "Frames without motion vectors (or with temporal history off): the network's noise seed\nmoves every frame, as NVIDIA's DLL does. Off keeps it still, since without a history to\naverage it a moving seed shimmers on a still picture.", "没有运动矢量的帧（或关闭了时域历史时）：网络的噪声种子每帧变化，\n和 NVIDIA 的 DLL 一样。关闭则让它保持不变，因为没有历史来做平均时，\n变化的种子会让静止画面闪烁。" },
{ "Frametime: %.2fms / %.1ffps (avg: %.1ffps)", "帧时间：%.2fms / %.1ffps（平均：%.1ffps）" },
{ "Free and always free", "免费，永远免费" },
{ "Freezes the frame the model works on. While held, change paper white, the\nstrengths, the reversible mode, the model preset -- anything below the\nupscaler -- and only that setting moves; the scene does not.\n\nWhat it CANNOT show: DLSS/FSR/XeSS upscaler presets or anything upstream\n(the upscaler is not re-run on a held frame), and the game's own HUD and\npost-processing, which run after this pass and keep updating. The white\npoint stops being measured and holds its value while frozen, so it cannot\ndrift and confound the comparison.\n\nHide the menu and it stays held. Untoggle to resume.", "定格模型正在处理的那一帧。定格期间可以更改纸白、各项强度、\n可逆模式、模型预设 -- 超分之后的任何东西 --\n只有那项设置在变，场景不变。\n\n它“无法”展示的：DLSS/FSR/XeSS 超分预设或任何上游的东西\n（定格的帧不会重新跑超分），以及游戏自己的 HUD 和后处理，\n它们在这一步之后运行，会继续更新。定格期间白点停止测量\n并保持其数值，所以不会漂移而干扰对比。\n\n隐藏菜单后仍保持定格。取消勾选即可恢复。" },
