{ "How far CC_SILVER_AARDWOLD_OPTIMIZED goes; every level stays close to CC_SILVER_AARDWOLD's\npicture. Quality: no int4 layers. Balanced: int4 on some encoder, attention and feed-forward\nlayers. Performance: also fixed attention on the first full-resolution layers. Ultra\nPerformance (default, the fastest): also more int4 layers. A change rebuilds the network.", "CC_SILVER_AARDWOLD_OPTIMIZED 优化到什么程度；每一档都接近\nCC_SILVER_AARDWOLD 的画面。质量：没有 int4 层。平衡：部分编码器、\n注意力和前馈层使用 int4。性能：最前面的全分辨率层还使用固定注意力。\n超级性能（默认，最快）：还有更多 int4 层。更改会重建网络。" },
{ "How far each a-trous pass returns a downward-biased estimate\ninstead of the bilateral mean, which bounds the floor below the\nraw colour rather than letting it drift above it. Off by default:\nthe crossing it removes measures about 0.1% of a typical frame,\nwith spikes in views where detail boost lifts the floor.\nFloor Detail Boost is the knob that fixes a soft floor.", "每次 a-trous 遍在多大程度上返回偏低的估计值，\n而不是双边均值；这会把 floor 限制在原始颜色之下，\n而不让它漂到上面。默认关闭：\n它消除的越界在典型画面中约占 0.1%，\n在 detail boost 抬高 floor 的视角下会出现尖峰。\n要修正偏软的 floor，该用 Floor Detail Boost。" },
{ "How far the frame moves toward the model's picture.\n\nThe model's answer is not added to the frame -- it is a complete picture of its\nown, rescaled so its luminance sits where the original says it should. This\nblends between the two, so both ends are real pictures and everything between\nthem is one too.\n\n0 gives back exactly what the upscaler produced. 1 is the model's picture.\n\nAbove 1 carries on past it in the same direction, which is not something the\nmodel asked for -- use it to see what it is doing, then come back down. This\nis the control to push if you want more effect: Intensity belongs to the model\nand it decides what to do with it.", "画面向模型的画面靠拢多少。\n\n模型的结果不是加到画面上的 -- 它本身就是一幅完整的画面，\n经过重新缩放，让亮度落在原画面指定的位置。这里是在两者之间混合，\n所以两端都是真实的画面，中间的每一点也都是。\n\n0 原样返回超分的输出。1 就是模型的画面。\n\n超过 1 会沿同一方向继续越过它，这并不是模型要求的 --\n可以用它看清模型在做什么，然后再调回来。想要更强的效果就该调这个：\n“强度”属于模型，由模型决定怎么用它。" },
{ "How far the handover moves from the floor toward the detail filter.\n0.0: the floor's 5x5 full median and a-trous result. Isotropic, so it\nerases strokes thinner than about 3 pixels - this is what removes panel\ntext and blends the original colours.\n1.0: entirely the filter selected below.", "handover 从 floor 向细节滤波器移动多少。\n0.0：floor 的 5x5 全中值加 a-trous 的结果。各向同性，\n所以会抹掉细于约 3 像素的笔画 - 面板文字被抹掉、\n原始颜色被混在一起就是因为它。\n1.0：完全使用下面选择的滤波器。" },
{ "How long to spin if FPTHybridSpin is true. Measured in timer resolution units.\nNot recommended to go below 2. Will result in frequent overshoots", "FPTHybridSpin 为 true 时自旋多久。以定时器分辨率为单位。\n不建议低于 2，那样会频繁过冲" },
{ "How many frames may be running denoise at once, 2-5. A frame that gets\na buffer waits for its own denoise; one that finds all buffers busy is\nrecorded with NO denoise at all - faster, with possible quality loss.\n\n3 (default): on Onimusha no difference from 2 was detected. In one Where\nWinds Meet A/B session, the skip counter rose by about 1200-1440 per\ntwo-slot segment and stayed flat with 3; that log window does not yield\na skip percentage.\n\n2: in that Where Winds Meet session, display latency was 47.6-47.9 ms\nversus 62.9-63.2 ms with 3, but many frames skipped denoise.\n\n4-5: measured in a separate sweep and no faster than 3 in that scene. A\nscene that actually requires a fourth or fifth slot has not been tested.\n\nEach buffer is one FP16 target at the RENDER size (the DLSS input): about\n29 MB when a 4K output renders at 1440p, 66 MB only at a native 4K render.\nOnly the selected number is allocated. No restart needed.\n\nThe ini also accepts 1 (the old single-slot path); this menu does not.", "同时可以有多少帧在进行降噪，2-5。拿到缓冲区的帧会等待\n自己的降噪完成；发现所有缓冲区都被占用的帧则完全\n“不降噪”地记录 - 更快，但画质可能受损。\n\n3（默认）：在 Onimusha 中没有测出与 2 的差别。在一次 Where\nWinds Meet 的 A/B 测试中，每个双槽片段里跳过计数增加约 1200-1440，\n用 3 时则保持不变；那段日志窗口无法得出跳过的百分比。\n\n2：在那次 Where Winds Meet 测试中，显示延迟为 47.6-47.9 ms，\n而用 3 时为 62.9-63.2 ms，但很多帧跳过了降噪。\n\n4-5：在另一轮测试中测得，在该场景下并不比 3 快。\n真正需要第四或第五个槽的场景尚未测试。\n\n每个缓冲区是一张“渲染”尺寸（即 DLSS 输入）的 FP16 目标：\n4K 输出以 1440p 渲染时约 29 MB，只有原生 4K 渲染时才是 66 MB。\n只分配所选的数量。无需重启。\n\nini 中还可以填 1（旧的单槽路径）；本菜单不行。" },
{ "How many times the model runs over the frame, each pass shown the last one's\nanswer.\n\nThe most expensive control here. Cost is exactly linear: five passes is\nfive model runs, and the model is nearly all of what this pass costs.\n\nWhat it buys that nothing else can is the model re-deciding where detail\ngoes, what hue it is, and how saturated. Detail strength amplifies the map\nthe first pass drew; it cannot redraw it.\n\nWhat it does not buy is raw magnitude. Detail strength and Intensity are\nfree and do that. Try both, and raise Model resolution, before this.\n\nPast 3, raise the ratio guard under Colour with it. The passes compound\nthe luminance ratio and the guard clamps it, so beyond its limit the extra\nruns are paid for and thrown away.\n\nEach pass is its own model, with its own memory, built on a frame of its\nown -- so raising this takes a couple of seconds to arrive, and VRAM grows\nwith it.\n\nNo effect on native Vulkan, or with the proxy path switched on.", "模型在画面上运行多少次，每一遍看到的是上一遍的结果。\n\n这里开销最大的控件。开销严格线性：五遍就是运行五次模型，\n而这一步的开销几乎全在模型上。\n\n它能换来而别的都换不来的，是让模型重新决定细节放在哪里、\n是什么色相、饱和度多高。“细节强度”只是放大第一遍画出的图，\n无法重画它。\n\n它换不来的是单纯的幅度。“细节强度”和“强度”不花开销就能做到。\n先试试这两项，并提高“模型分辨率”，再考虑这个。\n\n超过 3 时，请同时调高“颜色”下的“高光保护”。各遍会让亮度比值\n叠加，而保护会把它钳住，所以超出其上限后，\n多出来的几遍花了开销却被丢掉。\n\n每一遍都是独立的模型，有自己的内存，构建在它自己的一帧上 --\n所以调高后要过几秒才生效，VRAM 占用也随之增长。\n\n在原生 Vulkan 上，或开启 proxy 路径时无效。" },
{ "How much of NR's change reaches the people in the mask: 1 the pass they keep, 0 the game's own\npicture there. Before the stabilizer and RenoDX's composition, which still act on the result.", "NR 的改动有多少作用到遮罩中的人物上：1 为他们保留的那一遍，\n0 为该处游戏自己的画面。在稳定器和 RenoDX 的合成之前，它们仍会作用于结果。" },
{ "How much of it lands", "生效多少" },
{ "How much of the frame each half shows.\n\nA half is half as wide as the frame and just as tall, so the frame\ncannot fill it and keep its shape.\n\nAt 1 the whole frame is there at its right proportions, with bars above\nand below. At 2 the half is filled and the sides are cropped away\ninstead. Anything between trades one for the other.", "每一半显示画面的多少。\n\n每一半的宽度是画面的一半、高度相同，所以画面无法\n既填满它又保持比例。\n\n为 1 时整幅画面按正确比例显示，上下有黑边。\n为 2 时这一半被填满，两侧则被裁掉。\n介于两者之间则是在二者间取舍。" },
{ "How much of the model's colour change reaches the frame. Above 1 it is\nexaggerated, up to twice its size at 2.", "模型的颜色变化有多少作用到画面上。超过 1 时会被夸大，\n为 2 时达到两倍。" },
{ "How much of the model's detail reaches the frame. Above 1 it is\nexaggerated, up to twice its size at 2.", "模型的细节有多少作用到画面上。超过 1 时会被夸大，\n为 2 时达到两倍。" },
{ "How much of the network's result reaches the frame. 100% is the\nruntime's own default; 0% leaves the frame as the game drew it while\nthe network still runs. Above 100% the effect is pushed further.\n\nWith RenoDX composition on, this is the composition's intensity: above\n100% only the brightness change grows, inside the highlight guard, and\nchanging it keeps the model's history. Off, it sets the runtime's own\nstrength and every change restarts the model's history.\n\nNeeds the danielblnc runtime 0.3.1 or later without the composition.", "网络的结果有多少作用到画面上。100% 是运行时自己的默认值；\n0% 让画面保持游戏绘制的样子，而网络仍在运行。\n超过 100% 时效果会被进一步加强。\n\n开启 RenoDX 合成时，这就是合成的强度：超过 100% 时\n只有亮度变化会增大（在高光保护范围内），\n更改它会保留模型的历史。关闭时，它设置的是运行时自己的强度，\n每次更改都会重置模型的历史。\n\n不使用合成时，需要 danielblnc 运行时 0.3.1 或更高版本。" },
{ "How much of the previous frame's result the network's last block blends into this\none. Lower follows changes faster and steadies less. Even at 0 the network still\nreads the history; turn Temporal history off to drop it.", "网络的最后一个块把上一帧结果混入当前帧的比例。\n越低，跟随变化越快，稳定作用越弱。即使为 0，网络仍会读取历史；\n要彻底不用它，请关闭“时域历史”。" },
{ "How the game's depth buffer is interpreted.\nAuto trusts a depth-stencil resource over the title's declaration,\nthen the DLSS.Use.HW.Depth declaration, then the resource flags,\nand finally assumes Hardware. The log reports which rule fired.\n\nA title that supplies hardware depth without declaring it makes RR\nsee a scene about one unit deep: the linear-depth debug view goes\nblack and disocclusion stops working. Set Hardware if you see that.\nApplied immediately; changing it resets temporal history.", "如何解读游戏的深度缓冲。\n“自动”优先相信深度模板资源，而不是游戏的声明，\n其次是 DLSS.Use.HW.Depth 声明，再次是资源标志，\n最后假定为“硬件”。日志会记录是哪条规则生效。\n\n如果游戏提供了硬件深度却没有声明，RR 看到的场景\n就只有大约一个单位深：线性深度调试视图变黑，\n去遮挡也不再起作用。遇到这种情况请设为“硬件”。\n立即生效；更改会重置时域历史。" },
{ "How the model's work is brought back up when it ran below the frame's size.\n\nClassic composes the model's small picture directly against the full-size\nframe. Those two disagree by the shrink's blur as well as by the model's edit,\nand the composition cannot tell them apart -- it reads the blur as brightness\nthe frame has and the model never saw. The lower the model resolution the\nlarger that error, and it is the colour shift that shows up at 50%.\n\nMatched residual carries up only the model's difference and lays it on the\nframe's own proxy, so both pictures being compared are full size and the only\nthing that came from the small raster is the edit itself.\n\nNo effect at 100% or above: there is no residual to carry and the two are\nidentical (supersampling brings its answer down to frame size before this).\n\nFrom hhkbble's multi-pass work on this fork.", "模型以低于画面尺寸运行时，它的结果如何放大回来。\n\n“经典”把模型的小图直接与全尺寸画面合成。两者的差别除了模型的编辑，\n还有缩小带来的模糊，而合成无法区分它们 -- 它会把模糊当成\n画面有而模型没见过的亮度。模型分辨率越低，这个误差越大，\n50% 时出现的偏色就是它。\n\n“匹配残差”只把模型造成的差异带上来，叠加到画面自己的 proxy 上，\n所以参与比较的两幅图都是全尺寸的，唯一来自小尺寸栅格的\n只有编辑本身。\n\n100% 或以上时无效：没有残差可带，两者完全相同\n（超采样会在此之前把结果缩小到画面尺寸）。\n\n来自 hhkbble 在本分支上的多遍工作。" },
