{ "Ignores small depth differences before edge detection.\n\nHigher values reduce flickering and noise from minor depth changes, but may soften real geometry edges.\nLower values preserve fine detail but can cause unstable or noisy edge detection.", "在边缘检测之前忽略微小的深度差异。\n\n数值越高，越能减少细微深度变化带来的闪烁和噪点，但可能让真实的几何边缘变软。\n数值越低，越能保留精细细节，但可能导致边缘检测不稳定或有噪点。" },
