{ "Keeps the mask in 0..1 before the network sees it (after the invert).\nSome games (Resident Evil Requiem) write values up to 3000, which DLSS-RR takes as they are\nand which leave trails and shimmering here. Only does something while the mask is in use.", "在网络看到遮罩之前（反转之后）把它限制在 0..1。\n有些游戏（Resident Evil Requiem）会写入高达 3000 的值，DLSS-RR 原样接受，\n但在这里会留下拖尾和闪烁。只在遮罩被使用时才有作用。" },
