{ "Leaves Streamline, Reflex and FG control to the game/external mod.\nNR and NGX upscaling remain available. Save Settings and restart.\nDoes not install an unlocker or enable FG in unsupported games.", "把 Streamline、Reflex 和 FG 的控制权留给游戏/外部模组。\nNR 和 NGX 超分仍然可用。请点“保存设置”并重启。\n不会安装解锁器，也不会在不支持的游戏中启用 FG。" },
