{ "Lets you override each preset's ratio individually\nNote that not every game supports every quality preset\n\n1.5x on a 1080p screen means internal resolution of 720p\n1080 / 1.5 = 720", "可以单独覆盖每个预设的比例\n注意并非每个游戏都支持所有质量预设\n\n在 1080p 屏幕上 1.5x 表示内部分辨率为 720p\n1080 / 1.5 = 720" },
