{ "Linear hands the frame over unchanged, as danielblnc's own runtime does.\nsRGB and Gamma 2.2 decode it to linear light before the model and encode\nits answer back afterwards, which weakens the model's colour and lighting.\nSome games may still look better with one of them.", "“线性”原样交出画面，和 danielblnc 自己的运行时一样。\nsRGB 和 Gamma 2.2 会在进模型之前把它解码为线性光，之后再把\n结果编码回去，这会削弱模型的颜色和光照。\n有些游戏用其中之一可能仍然更好看。" },
