{ "List of FGs reported by FFX SDK", "FFX SDK 报告的 FG 列表" },
{ "List of upscalers reported by FFX SDK", "FFX SDK 报告的超分列表" },
{ "Live diagnostic browser for full-resolution shader-readable textures. It tracks completed GPU write transitions and keeps selection attached to the resource pointer across refreshes. D3D12 event names identify the nearest producing pass when the game emits markers; this is correlation evidence, not a semantic guarantee. Producer PSO IDs correlate resources with the graphics or compute pipeline that wrote them. It never inserts resource barriers.", "全分辨率、着色器可读纹理的实时诊断浏览器。它跟踪已完成的 GPU 写入状态转换，并在刷新时让选择保持绑定在资源指针上。游戏发出标记时，D3D12 事件名可指出最近的生产通道；这只是关联性证据，不是语义上的保证。生产者 PSO ID 把资源与写入它们的图形或计算管线关联起来。它从不插入资源屏障。" },
