{ "Low latency timings, whole frame: %.1fms", "低延迟计时，整帧：%.1fms" },
{ "Lower: More aggressive firefly removal, but may dim bright highlights.\nHigher: Preserves bright lights better, but may allow fireflies and noise through.", "调低：更强力地去除萤火虫噪点，但可能让明亮的高光变暗。\n调高：更好地保留亮光，但可能放过萤火虫噪点和噪声。" },
{ "Lowers only the fine detail NR adds to people; its broader light and colour stay. 1 leaves it.\nThe whole person mask, not skin or faces.", "只降低 NR 给人物添加的精细细节；大范围的光照和颜色保留。1 为不改动。\n作用于整个人物遮罩，而不只是皮肤或脸。" },
{ "Lowers the model's resolution while the game runs under the target frame\nrate, in steps of 85%, 70%, 55% and 40% of the resolution above.\n\nIt steps down after 2 s under the target and back up after 5 s with 15%\nheadroom, and waits 10 s after every change (60 s after a step down\nbefore it tries to go back up). Each change rebuilds the model, so the\neffect is off for one to five seconds and its history restarts.\n\nThe AMD runtime keeps a little more VRAM after every rebuild, so it makes\nat most 8 changes per session and then stays where it is. Turning this\noff and on again resets the count.\n\nWith a frame cap, set the target a little below the cap, or it never\nsees the headroom to step back up.", "游戏帧率低于目标时降低模型的分辨率，\n按上面分辨率的 85%、70%、55% 和 40% 逐级降低。\n\n低于目标 2 秒后降一级，有 15% 余量并持续 5 秒后升回一级，\n每次更改后等待 10 秒（降级之后要等 60 秒才会尝试升回）。\n每次更改都会重建模型，所以效果会关闭一到五秒，\n历史也会重新开始。\n\nAMD 运行时每次重建后都会多占一点 VRAM，所以每次会话\n最多更改 8 次，之后就停在当前级别。把此项关掉再打开\n会重置计数。\n\n有帧数上限时，请把目标设得比上限略低一些，\n否则它永远看不到升回去所需的余量。" },
