{ "Make a copy of depth to use with OptiFG\nFor preventing corruptions that might happen", "创建一份深度副本供 OptiFG 使用\n用于防止可能出现的画面损坏" },
{ "Make a copy of motion vectors to use with OptiFG\nFor preventing corruptions that might happen", "创建一份运动矢量副本供 OptiFG 使用\n用于防止可能出现的画面损坏" },
{ "Make the picture look right, then press this -- it captures the current look\nas a point. For the first point use the Paper white slider above; for\nevery point after, move to different light and use the Trim, which the\nAnchor then bakes into a new point.\n\nThe first press calibrates one point -- the white point then\nfollows the scan by ratio from there, as before. Walk into very\ndifferent light, set paper white again, and press it again: the\nsecond point pins down the buffer's real curve and everything\nbetween the two is right, not just near one anchor. Up to eight.\n\nThe table is per game and shareable: one person calibrates a game\nand the numbers are the same for everyone who takes the profile.", "先把画面调到看起来合适，再按这个 -- 它会把当前效果记为一个点。\n第一个点用上面的“纸白”滑块；之后的每个点，\n先走到不同的光照下再用“微调”，\n然后锚点会把它固化成一个新点。\n\n第一次按下会校准一个点 -- 之后白点和以前一样，\n从那里按比例跟随扫描。走到差别很大的光照下，\n重新设置纸白，再按一次：第二个点会确定缓冲区的真实曲线，\n两点之间全都是对的，而不只是在某个锚点附近。最多八个。\n\n这张表按游戏保存，可以分享：一个人校准了某个游戏，\n所有使用该配置的人得到的数字都一样。" },
{ "Makes a copy of the depth buffer\nCan fix broken visuals in some games on AMD GPUs under Windows\nCan cause stutters, so best to use only when necessary", "创建一份深度缓冲的副本\n可修复 Windows 下 AMD GPU 上某些游戏的画面异常\n可能导致卡顿，所以最好只在必要时使用" },
{ "Makes the floor's luminance test symmetric between centre and tap.\nThe centre-only form routes the two sides of one bright edge\ndifferently, one into the skip path and one into the denoiser.\n0.0 restores the previous behaviour.", "让 floor 的亮度测试在中心和采样点之间对称。\n只看中心的形式会把同一条亮边的两侧送往不同的路径，\n一侧进入跳过路径，一侧进入降噪器。\n0.0 恢复以前的行为。" },
