{ "NR without upscaling runs on the danielblnc and mochizuki runtimes. NrBackend\nis off, so this session runs no NR.", "不带超分的 NR 运行在 danielblnc 和 mochizuki 运行时上。\nNrBackend 为 off，所以本次会话不运行 NR。" },
{ "NR without upscaling runs on the danielblnc and mochizuki runtimes. lmxxf runs\ninside an upscaler call, so a game without one gets no NR.", "不带超分的 NR 运行在 danielblnc 和 mochizuki 运行时上。\nlmxxf 在超分调用内部运行，所以没有超分的游戏就没有 NR。" },
{ "NR without upscaling: optical flow, scene resets, fixed noise seed and depth when available. Includes the game's HUD. D3D9, D3D11, D3D12, Vulkan and OpenGL. RenoDX composition does not apply here.", "不带超分的 NR：光流、场景重置、固定噪声种子，有深度时也使用深度。包含游戏的 HUD。支持 D3D9、D3D11、D3D12、Vulkan 和 OpenGL。RenoDX 合成在这里不适用。" },
{ "NR: %s", "NR: %s" },
{ "NVIDIA's internal automatic mask, not the colour-based preview below.\nWith Skin structure=-1 it follows general structure, so the difference may be subtle.\nTry Skin structure=0 versus Local structure=1 to compare. Mask accuracy is model-dependent.", "NVIDIA 内部的自动遮罩，不是下面基于颜色的预览。\n“皮肤结构”=-1 时它跟随整体结构，所以差别可能很细微。\n可以试试“皮肤结构”=0 对比“局部结构”=1。遮罩的准确度取决于模型。" },
{ "Native resolution? You must be joking", "原生分辨率？你在开玩笑吧" },
{ "Natural", "自然" },
{ "Natural and Cinematic: the network's answer is graded afterwards, as NVIDIA's DLL\ndoes, so the two styles look apart. Off gives the picture they had before (little\ndifference in some games). Standard is not graded. No rebuild.", "“自然”和“电影感”：网络的结果之后会再调色，和 NVIDIA 的 DLL 一样，\n这样两种风格才有区别。关闭则得到它们以前的画面\n（在某些游戏中差别很小）。“标准”不调色。无需重建。" },
