{ "New, building", "新版，构建中" },
{ "New: cheaper kernels for a lower GPU time (about 10%), at a small, measured loss\nof image precision. Legacy: the kernels from before, closest to NVIDIA's output.\nFast (experimental): New with more cut, and the deepest levels of the network\nread from the previous frame: faster than New (about 6%), at a larger loss. Look at\nvery bright points and at stability in motion; a runtime without it runs New.\nSame network and histories, so it flips live and you can compare back and forth.\nThe first time, the kernels are built in the background (up to a minute), and\nthe image stays on Legacy until then.", "新版：更省的内核，GPU 时间更低（约 10%），代价是经过测量的少量\n图像精度损失。旧版：以前的内核，最接近 NVIDIA 的输出。\n快速（实验性）：在新版基础上进一步精简，并且网络最深的几层\n读取上一帧的结果：比新版更快（约 6%），损失更大。请留意\n非常亮的光点和运动中的稳定性；不支持它的 runtime 会运行新版。\n网络和历史相同，所以可以实时切换、来回对比。\n第一次使用时，内核会在后台构建（最多一分钟），\n在此之前画面保持使用旧版。" },
