{ "Off", "关闭" },
{ "Off (default): the model keeps its temporal history, building each frame\non the ones before it, which steadies the image. The upscaler accumulates\ntoo, so some ghosting is possible.\n\nOn: every frame is processed on its own, with no history. Less ghosting,\nmore flicker and shimmer. With the INI-only single slot (AmdSlots=1) the\nrender thread also waits for the model every frame.\n\nChanging it restarts the model's history.", "关闭（默认）：模型保留时域历史，每一帧都建立在之前的帧上，\n让画面更稳定。超分也会累积，所以可能出现一些鬼影。\n\n开启：每一帧独立处理，没有历史。鬼影更少，\n闪烁和闪动更多。使用仅 INI 可设的单槽（AmdSlots=1）时，\n渲染线程还会每帧等待模型。\n\n更改会重置模型的历史。" },
{ "Off (soft knee)", "关闭（软拐点）" },
{ "Off for this session: %s.", "本次会话已关闭：%s。" },
{ "Off preserves colour in selected pixels; lighting/detail can still change.\nAlso set Skin detail / lighting to 0 to suppress both.", "关闭时保留所选像素的颜色；光照/细节仍可能变化。\n把“皮肤细节/光照”也设为 0 可同时抑制两者。" },
{ "Off. The model stays loaded, so turning this back on is immediate.", "已关闭。模型仍保持加载，所以重新开启是即时的。" },
{ "Off: the new model of NVIDIA's 310.9.16 DLL (lmxxf 0.44's Small), about a third\nfaster, when native-game-tiled-assets\\small is installed (without it the old\none runs anyway), with any number of passes.\nOn: the 71-block model lmxxf ran before. Switching rebuilds the model.", "关闭：NVIDIA 310.9.16 DLL 的新模型（lmxxf 0.44 的 Small），快约三分之一，\n前提是安装了 native-game-tiled-assets\\small（没有的话仍运行旧模型），\n遍数不限。\n开启：lmxxf 以前运行的 71 块模型。切换会重建模型。" },
{ "Oh great, another potato PC", "好极了，又一台土豆电脑" },
{ "Old model", "旧模型" },
{ "On", "开启" },
{ "On (default): danielblnc's runtime uses the same noise every frame. With a new\nnoise each frame, the model's temporal history shows it as flicker and\nshimmer under an upscaler. danielblnc 0.4.1 to 0.8.0.", "开启（默认）：danielblnc 的运行时每帧使用相同的噪声。如果每帧\n换一个新噪声，模型的时域历史会在超分之下把它表现为\n闪烁和闪动。danielblnc 0.4.1 到 0.8.0。" },
{ "On the RX 6000: runs ACO's gfx10.3 machine code when dlssnr-amd\\aco-gfx103x is\ninstalled (experimental); without it, or with this off, the driver compiles the\nnetwork. Save Settings and start the game again to apply it.", "在 RX 6000 上：安装了 dlssnr-amd\\aco-gfx103x 时运行 ACO 的 gfx10.3\n机器码（实验性）；没有它或关闭此项时，由驱动编译网络。\n点“保存设置”并重新启动游戏后生效。" },
{ "On, the network's change comes back through the curve's bounded inverse. Off, as\nits ratio in the picture the network was shown. RenoDX stage, HDR frames.", "开启时，网络的改动通过曲线的有界逆变换返回。关闭时，\n按它在给网络看的画面中的比值返回。RenoDX 阶段，HDR 画面。" },
{ "On: New wait mode (1-pixel draw, runtime 0.3.1 or later). Still being tested.\nOff: Original wait mode (switches immediately).\nRestart if prompted: hooks or a pass may not be ready for new wait mode.\nFrames that cannot use new wait mode still fall back to original wait.", "开启：新等待模式（1 像素绘制，运行时 0.3.1 或更高）。仍在测试中。\n关闭：原始等待模式（立即切换）。\n如有提示请重启：挂钩或某一遍可能还没为新等待模式准备好。\n无法使用新等待模式的帧仍会回退到原始等待。" },
{ "One more stutter and I might lose it", "再卡一下我可能就要疯了" },
{ "One pass: lower the strength or the detail for the protection to do anything.", "只有一遍：要让保护起作用，请调低强度或细节。" },
{ "One that only ever climbs is a counter, not an exposure.", "只增不减的是计数器，不是曝光值。" },
{ "Only FG", "仅 FG" },
{ "Only FSR1 and Bicubic are supported when Ratio is below 1.0.", "比例低于 1.0 时只支持 FSR1 和 Bicubic。" },
{ "Only hook ntdll.dll methods\nDisable for switching back to kernel hooks", "只挂钩 ntdll.dll 的方法\n禁用后切换回 kernel 挂钩" },
{ "Only limits the FPS", "只限制 FPS" },
{ "Only the chosen model runs. PP-HumanSeg (default) and YOLO11n-seg cover the whole body; YuNet\nkeeps a soft oval on each face it finds, so hair and clothes take every pass. Small, turned or\nhidden faces can be missed. CPU time per mask, measured on an 8-core desktop CPU: about 6 ms,\n40 ms and 2 ms. A change restarts the model.", "只运行所选的模型。PP-HumanSeg（默认）和 YOLO11n-seg 覆盖全身；YuNet 在\n找到的每张脸上保留一个柔和的椭圆，所以头发和衣服会经过每一遍。\n小的、转过去的或被遮住的脸可能会漏掉。每张遮罩的 CPU 耗时\n（在 8 核桌面 CPU 上测得）：约 6 ms、40 ms 和 2 ms。更改会重启模型。" },
