{ "OpenRR stopped, see the log", "OpenRR 已停止，请查看日志" },
{ "OpenRR: %s", "OpenRR: %s" },
{ "Opt-in energy guard on the floor/raw clamp: the floor may not\nexceed the raw, so the share that does is replaced with a low\npass of the raw sample. That replacement is the raw's own\nnoise, and the skip signal publishes it unfiltered - so this\nputs grain back on exactly the pixels it clamps. Averaging the\nceiling attenuates it but cannot remove it, because an average\nof the raw still carries the raw's noise. 0.0 - the default -\nleaves the floor unclamped and closes the residual instead,\nwhich removes the grain rather than reducing it. Watch\nSkipRawInject to see the pixels the clamp takes.", "floor/raw 钳制上可选开启的能量保护：floor 不得超过 raw，\n所以超出的部分会被替换为 raw 样本的低通结果。\n这个替换值就是 raw 自己的噪声，而 skip signal 会不经过滤\n地输出它 - 所以恰恰是在被钳制的像素上把颗粒放了回去。\n对上限取平均能削弱它，但无法消除，\n因为 raw 的平均值仍然带着 raw 的噪声。\n0.0（默认）不钳制 floor，而是改为闭合残差，\n这样是消除颗粒而不是减轻它。\n查看 SkipRawInject 可以看到被钳制的像素。" },
