{ "Pointer-valued NGX parameters visible to the RR backend. Exact D3D12 resources include texture metadata. Opaque pointers are listed by key and address only because they may be matrices, callbacks, or other objects.", "RR 后端可见的指针类型 NGX 参数。确切的 D3D12 资源会附带纹理元数据。不透明指针只按键名和地址列出，因为它们可能是矩阵、回调或其他对象。" },
{ "Positioning", "定位" },
