{ "Prefer the title's own linearised view depth over the one\nderived from its depth buffer and projection. Off by\ndefault: the derived path is the one every title so far has\nbeen validated against. The TitleLinearDepthDiff view shows\nwhether the title's field agrees; changing this resets\ntemporal history.", "优先使用游戏自己的线性化视图深度，而不是\n由其深度缓冲和投影推导出的深度。默认关闭：\n迄今所有游戏都是在推导路径上验证的。\nTitleLinearDepthDiff 视图会显示游戏的数据是否一致；\n更改此项会重置时域历史。" },
