{ "Protect skin", "保护皮肤" },
{ "Proxy (what the model sees)", "Proxy（模型看到的画面）" },
{ "Proxy is the picture handed to the model -- if that looks wrong, the white point\nis wrong and nothing downstream can be judged.\n\nDifference shows what the model actually changed, amplified twenty times and\ncentred on grey. A flat grey frame there means it is doing nothing.", "Proxy 是交给模型的画面 -- 如果它看起来不对，说明白点不对，\n下游的一切都无从判断。\n\n“差异”显示模型实际改动了什么，放大二十倍并以灰色为中心。\n那里如果是一片均匀的灰，说明模型什么也没做。" },
{ "Purple", "紫色" },
{ "Pushes the floor filter's high-frequency luminance residual back\ninto the floor on its final pass, so texture microcontrast reaches\nthe output through the skip signal instead of the denoiser.\n0.0 restores the previous behaviour.", "在最后一遍把 floor 滤波器的高频亮度残差推回 floor，\n这样纹理的微对比度就通过 skip signal 而不是降噪器\n到达输出。\n0.0 恢复以前的行为。" },
{ "Put every %s setting on this page back to its default?", "把本页所有 %s 设置恢复为默认值？" },
{ "Puts the \"NR ON\" badge in a corner of the frame while Neural Rendering\nruns, so a screenshot or a video says it was on. It goes away by itself\nwhen NR is switched off, and needs no restart.", "Neural Rendering 运行时，在画面一角显示 \"NR ON\" 角标，\n这样截图或视频就能表明它是开着的。关闭 NR 后\n它会自行消失，无需重启。" },
{ "Puts the edited frame on the other side.\n\nWorth doing once you have decided which you prefer: the eye is not\neven-handed about left and right, and a difference can read as an\nimprovement purely from where it sits. If the same side still wins after\nswapping, it is the pass you are seeing and not the placement.", "把编辑后的画面换到另一侧。\n\n在你认定更喜欢哪个之后值得做一次：眼睛对左右并不是\n一视同仁的，一处差别可能仅仅因为所在位置就被看成改进。\n如果交换后还是同一方胜出，那你看到的就是这一步的效果，\n而不是位置的影响。" },
{ "Puts the network's change back on the game's own picture as a bounded gain, the way\nRenoDX's DLSS Neural Rendering add-on does, instead of taking the network's picture.\nHighlights the network clipped keep their range, and near-black areas are left alone.\nMost useful in HDR games. Off by default.", "把网络的改动以有界增益的形式放回游戏自己的画面，做法与 RenoDX 的\nDLSS Neural Rendering 插件相同，而不是直接采用网络的画面。\n被网络截掉的高光保留其范围，接近黑色的区域则不做改动。\n在 HDR 游戏中最有用。默认关闭。" },
{ "Quality", "质量" },
{ "Quality Preset", "质量预设" },
{ "Quirks", "Quirks" },
{ "Quirks and ASI", "Quirks 与 ASI" },
{ "RR 1.2 option controlling the maximum used to normalize AMD's linear-depth debug view.\nThis does not change the dispatch passthrough depth bounds.", "RR 1.2 选项，控制归一化 AMD 线性深度调试视图时所用的最大值。\n它不会改变 dispatch 直通的深度范围。" },
{ "RR Resource Inspector", "RR 资源检查器" },
{ "RR specular-network output remodulated with the actual bounded,\nsurface-stabilized type-1 material split supplied to the denoiser.", "RR 镜面网络的输出，用实际提供给降噪器的、有界且经表面稳定的\ntype-1 材质拆分重新调制。" },
{ "RTSS + XeFG detected", "检测到 RTSS + XeFG" },
{ "RTSS Reflex Injection is known to cause issues.\nEspecially when using XeFG.\nPlease disable it.", "已知 RTSS 的 Reflex 注入会引起问题，\n使用 XeFG 时尤其如此。\n请禁用它。" },
{ "RTSS hooks every present, including the ones frame generation makes,\nand holds them back. Close RivaTuner Statistics Server (and MSI\nAfterburner, which starts it), or turn off its hooking for this game.\n\nThe FPS limit below also goes through RTSS and counts the generated\nframes: with frame generation on, cap the frame rate another way.", "RTSS 会挂钩每一次 present，包括帧生成产生的那些，\n并把它们拦住。请关闭 RivaTuner Statistics Server（以及会启动它的\nMSI Afterburner），或关掉它对这个游戏的挂钩。\n\n下面的 FPS 上限也经过 RTSS，并且会把生成帧算进去：\n开启帧生成时，请用别的方式限制帧率。" },
{ "RX 6000", "RX 6000" },
{ "RX 6000 (experimental, FP16 network)", "RX 6000（实验性，FP16 网络）" },
{ "RX 7000", "RX 7000" },
{ "RX 7000 (experimental, FP16 network%s)", "RX 7000（实验性，FP16 网络%s）" },
{ "Radiance Clip Deviation", "辐射亮度裁剪偏差" },
{ "Raises the generated frame maximum in nvngx_dlssg.dll and in the count Streamline reports, so the ratio above offers up to 6X on pre-Blackwell cards. Patched in memory; the file on disk is not touched. Takes effect on the next game start.\n\nPacing above 2X is uneven -- the module expects Blackwell's flip metering hardware. Try DisableFlipMetering under [NvApi] alongside it.\n\nUndocumented and unsupported by NVIDIA.", "提高 nvngx_dlssg.dll 中以及 Streamline 所报告数量里的生成帧上限，这样在 Blackwell 之前的显卡上，上面的倍率最高可选 6X。在内存中打补丁；磁盘上的文件不会被改动。下次启动游戏时生效。\n\n2X 以上的帧步调不均匀 -- 该模块需要 Blackwell 的 flip metering 硬件。可以同时试试 [NvApi] 下的 DisableFlipMetering。\n\nNVIDIA 没有文档说明，也不提供支持。" },
{ "Raises the slider above to %d, which is far past what this pass\nwas built for. Expect the frame time to scale with it and the game to stop being\nplayable well before the top.\n\nCost is exactly linear and the model is nearly all of it, so ten passes is ten\nmodel runs in one frame. Each also holds an NGX feature with its own history,\nsized by the driver, and they are built one at a time with a settle between --\nreaching a large count takes a while and the frames spent building show nothing.\n\nThe ratio guard under Colour has to rise with the count or the extra passes\nspend their contribution against the clamp.", "把上面的滑块上限提高到 %d，这远远超出了这一步的设计范围。\n帧时间会随之增长，离最大值还很远时游戏就已经没法玩了。\n\n开销严格线性，而且几乎全在模型上，所以十遍就是一帧里运行十次模型。\n每一遍还各持有一个带独立历史的 NGX feature，大小由驱动决定，\n并且是一个一个构建的，中间还要等它稳定 --\n达到很大的遍数需要一段时间，构建期间的帧什么都不显示。\n\n“颜色”下的“高光保护”必须随遍数一起调高，\n否则多出来的几遍的贡献会被钳制抵消掉。" },
{ "Range: %.2f ms - %.2f ms", "范围：%.2f ms - %.2f ms" },
{ "Ratio", "比例" },
{ "Ratio override", "比例覆盖" },
{ "Raw DispatchFlags:", "原始 DispatchFlags：" },
{ "React. Mask Bias", "反应遮罩偏置" },
{ "Reactive Scale", "反应缩放" },
{ "Read-only probe for Streamline emissive, diffuse, specular, shadow, ambient-occlusion and hint tags. A half-width candidate confirms only the layout, not its phase. Shadow tags still need light metadata; hints are not RR signals.", "针对 Streamline 自发光、漫反射、镜面反射、阴影、环境光遮蔽和 hint 标签的只读探针。半宽的候选只能确认布局，不能确认其相位。阴影标签仍需要光源元数据；hint 不是 RR 信号。" },
{ "Reading the exposure...", "正在读取曝光..." },
{ "Reads the mouse right when the GPU starts the reprojection\ninstead of when the frame is presented on the CPU.\nLowers latency, especially when GPU bound", "在 GPU 开始重投影的那一刻读取鼠标，\n而不是在 CPU 上呈现该帧的时候。\n降低延迟，GPU 瓶颈时尤其明显" },
{ "Real DLSSG, For RTX 40xx and above", "真 DLSSG，适用于 RTX 40xx 及以上" },
{ "Real fake frames. Certified.", "货真价实的假帧。官方认证。" },
{ "Rebuild the HUDless by removing the UI texture from the frame\nFSR-FG gets the UI only this way, DLSSG also takes the UI texture directly", "通过从画面中去掉 UI 纹理来重建 HUDless\nFSR-FG 只能这样得到 UI，DLSSG 还可以直接接收 UI 纹理" },
{ "Records the probe readbacks and their log lines: the conversion's inputs\nand outputs, and the frame-wide shares reported\nbeside them. Off by default - seven render-target copies per probe, and an\nalways-on probe filled the log with a gigabyte of it in one session. The\nnumbers this reports are how every tuning decision in this fork was made,\nso turn it on before changing a floor or handover parameter.", "记录探针回读及其日志行：转换的输入和输出，\n以及旁边报告的全帧占比。\n默认关闭 - 每个探针要拷贝七个渲染目标，而且常开的探针\n曾在一次会话里往日志写了 1 GB。本分支的每个调校决定\n都是依据它报告的数字做出的，\n所以在更改 floor 或 handover 参数之前请先打开它。" },
{ "Recreates the RR context with AMD's internal diagnostics enabled.\nDebug output uses a dedicated RGBA16_FLOAT UAV and may increase VRAM use.\nLeave this disabled during normal play.", "在启用 AMD 内部诊断的情况下重建 RR 上下文。\n调试输出使用专用的 RGBA16_FLOAT UAV，可能增加 VRAM 占用。\n正常游玩时请保持禁用。" },
