{ "Relative to RR's OUTPUT resolution: 0.50x at 4K runs NR at 1920x1080.\nRR itself remains full quality. The NR edit is resized for final composition.\nPasses 2 and 3 use the same per-pass model profiles as the SR path.", "相对于 RR 的“输出”分辨率：4K 下 0.50x 表示 NR 以 1920x1080 运行。\nRR 本身保持全质量。NR 的编辑会缩放后用于最终合成。\n第 2、3 遍使用与 SR 路径相同的逐遍模型配置。" },
{ "Relative to the finished frame: 1.00x runs the model over every pixel of\nit, 0.50x at 4K runs it at 1920x1080 and enlarges the answer back.\nCost falls with the square of this, so it is the first control to reach\nfor when the full-size pass is too expensive.\n\nThe AMD runtime does not supersample, so this stops at 1.00x.", "相对于最终画面：1.00x 让模型处理它的每个像素，\n4K 下 0.50x 则以 1920x1080 运行，再把结果放大回来。\n开销按它的平方下降，所以全尺寸运行开销太大时，\n这是最先该调的控件。\n\nAMD 运行时不做超采样，所以最高到 1.00x。" },
{ "Relax resolution checks for HUDless by 32 pixels \nHelps games which use black borders for some \nresolutions and screen ratios (e.g. Witcher 3)", "把 HUDless 的分辨率检查放宽 32 像素\n对在某些分辨率和屏幕比例下使用黑边的游戏\n有帮助（如 Witcher 3）" },
{ "Relaxed Resource Check", "放宽资源检查" },
{ "Releases the floor's luminance edge stop where diffuse albedo says\ntwo taps share a material, so shadows and reflections reach the\ndenoiser instead of being captured into the floor and returned\nblurred. 0.0 restores the previous behaviour.", "当漫反射 albedo 表明两个采样点属于同一材质时，\n放开 floor 的亮度边缘停止，这样阴影和反射会到达降噪器，\n而不是被收进 floor 再模糊地返回。\n0.0 恢复以前的行为。" },
{ "Remembers what was around the camera in previous frames\nand uses it to fill the screen edges and the area under your hands.\nEdge fill mode is only used where the cache has nothing.\nShown with a blue tint in debug mode", "记住之前几帧里相机周围的内容，\n用它来填充屏幕边缘和你双手下方的区域。\n“边缘填充模式”只在缓存里没有内容的地方使用。\n调试模式下以蓝色显示" },
{ "Remove black lift", "去除黑位抬升" },
{ "Render", "渲染" },
{ "Render Presets Override", "渲染预设覆盖" },
{ "Render Width", "渲染宽度" },
{ "Render in your world. Upscale in ours", "在你的世界渲染，在我们的世界超分" },
{ "RenoDX composition", "RenoDX 合成" },
{ "Reprojection", "重投影" },
{ "Reprojection (WIP)", "重投影 (WIP)" },
{ "Reprojection Settings", "重投影设置" },
{ "Reprojection would swing the character around with the camera,\nso it gets paused while something in the middle of the screen follows the camera.\nUses the game's motion vectors and the cache parallax scale.\nVehicle cockpits can count as 3rd person too.\nDisable to keep reprojection always active", "重投影会让角色跟着相机一起甩动，\n所以当屏幕中间有东西跟随相机时它会暂停。\n使用游戏的运动矢量和缓存视差比例。\n载具驾驶舱也可能被算作第三人称。\n禁用后重投影始终保持启用" },
{ "Reprojects the game image using new mouse data\nKinda like Reflex 2, perceived latency improvement\n\n- REQUIRES DLSSG VIA STREAMLINE AS INPUT\n- Only works with first person perspective games\n- Only mouse, no controller\n- If possible, disable any mouse/camera smoothing in the game\n", "用新的鼠标数据对游戏画面做重投影\n有点像 Reflex 2，改善体感延迟\n\n- 需要以经 STREAMLINE 的 DLSSG 作为输入\n- 只适用于第一人称视角游戏\n- 只支持鼠标，不支持手柄\n- 如果可以，请关闭游戏里的鼠标/相机平滑\n" },
{ "Required for Debug flags to work correctly", "调试标志要正常工作需要它" },
{ "Requires Nukem's dlssg_to_fsr3 dll", "需要 Nukem 的 dlssg_to_fsr3 dll" },
{ "Requires an upscaler, or NR without upscaling with XeFG\n\nCan be used with any FG Output, but might be imperfect with some\nTo prevent UI glitching, HUDfix required", "需要超分，或配合 XeFG 的不带超分的 NR\n\n可搭配任意 FG 输出，但与某些搭配可能不完美\n要防止 UI 出错，需要 HUDfix" },
{ "Requires disabling dilated motion vectors", "需要禁用膨胀运动矢量" },
