{ "Reset to defaults", "恢复默认值" },
{ "Resets Frame generation rectangle", "重置帧生成矩形" },
{ "Resistance is futile. Your pixels will be upscaled.", "抵抗是徒劳的。你的像素将被超分。" },
{ "Resource", "资源" },
