{ "Responsivity Threshold", "响应度阈值" },
{ "Restart the game to apply correct XeFG settings!", "请重启游戏以应用正确的 XeFG 设置！" },
{ "Restart the game to retry new-wait initialization.", "请重启游戏以重试新等待模式的初始化。" },
{ "Restore Compute Root Signature", "恢复计算根签名" },
{ "Restore Graphic Root Signature", "恢复图形根签名" },
{ "Retry", "重试" },
{ "Reuse on still scenes", "静止场景时复用" },
{ "Reversible proxy (experimental)", "可逆 proxy（实验性）" },
{ "RivaTuner (RTSS) is running: with frame generation it causes", "RivaTuner (RTSS) 正在运行：开启帧生成时它会导致" },
{ "Root Signatures", "Root Signatures" },
{ "Roughness Addition", "粗糙度附加值" },
{ "Roughness added privately for exact-zero (type-1) surfaces only.\nRR reads exact zero as a perfect mirror and reprojects it through a\nvirtual hit position it cannot reconstruct; lifting the value gives the\ndenoiser something it can filter instead. 0.0000 disables the addition.\nThe game G-buffer and the exact-zero classification are unchanged - this\nvalue never leaves the RR input.", "仅对粗糙度恰好为零（type-1）的表面私下追加的粗糙度。\nRR 把恰好为零当作完美镜面，并通过一个它无法重建的\n虚拟命中位置对其重投影；把数值抬高一点，\n降噪器就有东西可以过滤了。0.0000 则不追加。\n游戏的 G-buffer 和“恰好为零”的分类都不变 -\n这个值不会离开 RR 的输入。" },
{ "Routes pixels flagged by the DLSS bias mask (particles, alpha\nlayers, animated and video textures) around the denoiser via the\nfloor and skip signal. 0.0 restores the previous behaviour.\nHas no effect on titles that provide no mask.", "让被 DLSS 偏置遮罩标记的像素（粒子、alpha 层、\n动画和视频纹理）经由 floor 和 skip signal 绕过降噪器。\n0.0 恢复以前的行为。\n对不提供遮罩的游戏无效。" },
{ "Run before the upscaler", "在超分之前运行" },
{ "Run inside the upscaler", "在超分内部运行" },
{ "Running natively on Vulkan - %llu frames%s", "原生运行在 Vulkan 上 - %llu 帧%s" },
{ "Running on: %s", "运行于：%s" },
{ "Running the FP8 experimental network", "正在运行 FP8 实验性网络" },
{ "Running the optimized network, Optimized layers: %s", "正在运行优化网络，优化层：%s" },
{ "Running%s - %.2f ms per frame%s", "运行中%s - 每帧 %.2f ms%s" },
{ "Runs FP8 matrices, which only an RX 9000 has.", "运行 FP8 矩阵，只有 RX 9000 才有。" },
{ "Runs NR on the D3D9, D3D11, D3D12, Vulkan or OpenGL frame when the game has no upscaler.\nRequires the danielblnc AMD runtime. The HUD is included.\nFidelityFX estimates motion. D3D11 uses a bound shader-readable depth buffer when available.\nVulkan shares the image with D3D12 when the driver permits; otherwise host readback adds latency.\nA classic D3D9 device copies each frame through system memory; D3D9Ex shares it with D3D12.\nOpenGL needs OptiScaler installed as opengl32.dll and shares the back buffer with D3D12.\nScene cuts reset history; the runtime noise seed is fixed on supported versions.", "游戏没有超分时，在 D3D9、D3D11、D3D12、Vulkan 或 OpenGL 的画面上运行 NR。\n需要 danielblnc 的 AMD 运行时。包含 HUD。\n运动由 FidelityFX 估算。D3D11 在有已绑定的着色器可读深度缓冲时会使用它。\n驱动允许时 Vulkan 与 D3D12 共享图像；否则主机回读会增加延迟。\n经典 D3D9 设备每帧要经系统内存拷贝；D3D9Ex 则与 D3D12 共享。\nOpenGL 需要把 OptiScaler 安装为 opengl32.dll，并与 D3D12 共享后备缓冲。\n场景切换会重置历史；在支持的版本上运行时的噪声种子是固定的。" },
{ "Runs Neural Rendering on the render-resolution colour input immediately before\nSuper Resolution, so SR temporally accumulates and upscales the enhanced frame.\n\nRay Reconstruction is deliberately excluded: its input contract differs and\nuses the separate Apply after Ray Reconstruction option. Origin-zero padded\ninputs use their active render size; offset or invalid inputs fall back post-SR.\n\nThis placement control currently applies to the Direct3D 12 path and its\nDirect3D 11/Vulkan bridges; native Vulkan keeps the post-upscale path.", "紧接在超分辨率之前，对渲染分辨率的颜色输入运行 Neural Rendering，\n这样 SR 会对增强后的画面做时域累积和放大。\n\n光线重建被有意排除在外：它的输入约定不同，\n使用单独的“在光线重建之后应用”选项。原点为零、带填充的输入\n使用其有效渲染尺寸；带偏移或无效的输入会回退到 SR 之后。\n\n这个位置控制目前适用于 Direct3D 12 路径及其\nDirect3D 11/Vulkan 桥接；原生 Vulkan 保持在超分之后的路径。" },
{ "Runs before Super Resolution only, so a game driving Ray Reconstruction gets no NR. Built for a render resolution of 1080p or less.", "只在超分辨率之前运行，所以使用光线重建的游戏没有 NR。为 1080p 或更低的渲染分辨率打造。" },
{ "Runs before Super Resolution only. The first start builds the network in about half a minute; later starts take a second or two.", "只在超分辨率之前运行。首次启动需约半分钟构建网络；之后的启动只要一两秒。" },
{ "Runs the AMD neural model over the finished frame instead of over the\nupscaler's or Ray Reconstruction's render-resolution input.\n\nWith it off the model stays pre-SR, on the render-resolution Color input\nbefore Super Resolution or DLSS-RR. Under FSR-RR it runs between the\ndenoise and the upscale, on the denoised colour.\n\nThe model history is rebuilt when the placement changes, so expect a few\nframes of warm-up after toggling it.", "在最终画面上运行 AMD 神经模型，而不是在超分或光线重建的\n渲染分辨率输入上运行。\n\n关闭时模型留在 SR 之前，作用于超分辨率或 DLSS-RR 之前的\n渲染分辨率 Color 输入。在 FSR-RR 下，它在降噪和超分之间运行，\n作用于降噪后的颜色。\n\n位置改变时模型历史会重建，所以切换后\n会有几帧的预热。" },
{ "Runs the model again on its own output, for a stronger effect.\nEach pass adds the model's whole GPU time to every frame.", "让模型在自己的输出上再运行一次，效果更强。\n每一遍都会给每帧加上模型的全部 GPU 时间。" },
{ "Runs the network as machine code made in advance by ACO, the Linux driver's compiler,\ninstead of compiling it with AMD's Windows one: about a fifth faster, the same picture.\nCC_SMALL_FP8_EXPERIMENTAL and CC_SILVER_AARDWOLD_OPTIMIZED need it. Tested by its\nauthor on AMD Software 26.9.2 only; if the game crashes or the picture is wrong, turn\nit off. Save Settings and start the game again to apply it.", "用 ACO（Linux 驱动的编译器）预先生成的机器码运行网络，而不是用 AMD 的\nWindows 编译器来编译：快约五分之一，画面相同。\nCC_SMALL_FP8_EXPERIMENTAL 和 CC_SILVER_AARDWOLD_OPTIMIZED 需要它。\n作者只在 AMD Software 26.9.2 上测试过；如果游戏崩溃或画面不对，\n请关闭它。点“保存设置”并重新启动游戏后生效。" },
{ "Runs the network at its full cost but shows the frame as the game drew it, to\nmeasure the cost or compare with and without the effect.", "以完整开销运行网络，但显示游戏绘制的原始画面，\n用于测量开销，或对比有无效果的差别。" },
{ "Safety Margins in ms", "安全余量 (ms)" },
{ "Safety margins in millisecons\nFSR default value: 0.1ms\nOpti default value: 0.01ms", "安全余量，单位为毫秒\nFSR 默认值：0.1ms\nOpti 默认值：0.01ms" },
{ "Same as menu", "与菜单相同" },
{ "Sample radius", "采样半径" },
{ "Saturation", "饱和度" },
{ "Save Settings", "保存设置" },
{ "Save Settings and restart the game for Enable and Pattern changes to apply", "“启用”和“模式匹配”的更改需点“保存设置”并重启游戏后生效" },
{ "Save Settings and restart the game: XeFG keeps the low latency output it started with", "请点“保存设置”并重启游戏：XeFG 会一直使用启动时的低延迟输出" },
{ "Save Settings and restart to apply the changes", "点“保存设置”并重启后更改生效" },
{ "Save Settings and restart to change frame-generation ownership.", "点“保存设置”并重启后才能更改帧生成的归属。" },
{ "Save Settings keeps it for the next start.", "点“保存设置”可保留到下次启动。" },
{ "Scale", "缩放" },
{ "Scale Depth to fix DLSS RR", "缩放深度以修复 DLSS RR" },
{ "Scales the graft weight, so the handover can be applied partially.\n1.000 is the full graft and 0.000 is inert.", "缩放嫁接权重，这样 handover 可以只应用一部分。\n1.000 为完全嫁接，0.000 为不起作用。" },
{ "Scan %.5f  ->  white point %.2f   (%u point)", "扫描 %.5f  ->  白点 %.2f   (%u 个点)" },
{ "Scan %.5f  ->  white point %.2f   (%u points)", "扫描 %.5f  ->  白点 %.2f   (%u 个点)" },
{ "Scheduling", "调度" },
{ "Screenshot", "截图" },
{ "Screenshots: %s", "截图：%s" },
{ "Select DLSS-FG in-game", "请在游戏内选择 DLSS-FG" },
{ "Select FSR-FG in-game", "请在游戏内选择 FSR-FG" },
{ "Select Overview or one of AMD's fullscreen RR 1.2 diagnostics.\nVirtual Hit Position validates camera data and specular ray distance\nfor low-roughness reflections.", "选择“概览”或 AMD 的某个全屏 RR 1.2 诊断视图。\n“虚拟命中位置”用于验证低粗糙度反射的相机数据\n和镜面光线距离。" },
{ "Select source for frametime\nMight help frame pacing and stutter issues", "选择帧时间的来源\n可能对帧步调和卡顿问题有帮助" },
{ "Select the input color space that the game uses.\nNon-Linear / sRGB: Might improve FSR4 upscaling quality, might increase ghosting.\nPQ: Rarest, might increase ghosting and break lights.", "选择游戏使用的输入色彩空间。\n非线性 / sRGB：可能提升 FSR4 超分质量，也可能增加鬼影。\nPQ：最少见，可能增加鬼影并让光源出错。" },
{ "Select the matching Direct or Indirect option under Diffuse Signal.\nA magenta view means the debug view and active diffuse signal type do not match.", "请在“漫反射信号”下选择对应的“直接”或“间接”选项。\n画面呈品红色说明调试视图与当前的漫反射信号类型不匹配。" },
{ "Select the sharpening filter to apply.\n\nUpscaler's default: Uses the sharpening provided by the upscaler.\nRCAS: AMD's RCAS, modified for Contrast and MAS.\nDepth Aware: Smarter sharpening with fewer artifacts (heavier).\n\nBy default uses a sharpening value provided by the game.\nSelect 'Override' under 'Sharpness' and adjust the slider to change it.", "选择要应用的锐化滤镜。\n\n超分默认：使用超分自带的锐化。\nRCAS：AMD 的 RCAS，为对比度和 MAS 做过修改。\n深度感知：更聪明的锐化，伪影更少（开销更大）。\n\n默认使用游戏提供的锐化值。\n要更改，请在“锐度”下选择“覆盖”，再调整滑块。" },
{ "Selects how many elements close to the camera\nshould be shown over the reprojected image.\nThis prevents your gun from being moved in weird ways.\n\nUse \"Show static elements\" to help you adjust it\nUnreal Engine games are usually around 0.10\nCyberpunk is around 0.02", "选择有多少靠近相机的元素\n要显示在重投影画面之上。\n这能防止你的枪被奇怪地移动。\n\n可以用 \"显示静态元素\" 来辅助调整\nUnreal Engine 游戏通常在 0.10 左右\nCyberpunk 在 0.02 左右" },
{ "Separate skin / environment controls", "皮肤/环境分开控制" },
{ "Set", "设置" },
{ "Set Static Position", "设置固定位置" },
{ "Set as FPS Limit", "设为 FPS 上限" },
{ "Set by XeFG: the game's own keeps its XeLL", "由 XeFG 设定：游戏自带的 XeFG 沿用其 XeLL" },
{ "Set by XeFG: the game's own keeps its XeLL (only the FPS limit is OptiScaler's)", "由 XeFG 设定：游戏自带的 XeFG 沿用其 XeLL（只有 FPS 上限由 OptiScaler 管）" },
{ "Sets ApplyAfterRR to false; danielblnc then runs before Super Resolution / Ray\nReconstruction too, if you switch back to it.", "把 ApplyAfterRR 设为 false；之后如果切换回 danielblnc，\n它也会在超分辨率/光线重建之前运行。" },
{ "Shaders", "着色器" },
{ "Shading Scale", "着色缩放" },
{ "Shape definition", "形状清晰度" },
{ "Sharp. override", "锐度覆盖" },
{ "Sharpness", "锐度" },
{ "Show Debug", "显示调试" },
{ "Show Detected UI", "显示检测到的 UI" },
{ "Show person mask", "显示人物遮罩" },
{ "Show static elements", "显示静态元素" },
{ "Show the light meter on screen", "在屏幕上显示测光表" },
{ "Showing %zu of %zu candidates", "显示 %zu / %zu 个候选项" },
{ "Shows the current render -> output resolution and upscale ratio in the overlay", "在叠加层中显示当前的渲染 -> 输出分辨率和超分比例" },
{ "Shows the model the frame the upscaler is about to read, instead of the one it\nwrote. The model runs at render resolution, so at Performance it costs about a\nquarter of what it costs after the upscaler, and it sees rendered pixels rather\nthan reconstructed ones.\n\nUnlike Model resolution this does not soften what the model returns: the model\nruns 1:1 on a smaller frame rather than small on a large one, and the upscaler\nenlarges its work along with everything else.\n\nUntested territory. Colour at this point is jittered by a different subpixel\noffset every frame and the model is given no way to know that, so its history\nmay reproject against an offset it cannot see. Look for shimmer and swimming on\nfine detail while the camera moves.", "给模型看超分即将读取的那一帧，而不是它写出的那一帧。\n模型以渲染分辨率运行，所以在“性能”档下，开销大约是放在超分之后的\n四分之一，而且它看到的是渲染出的像素，而不是重建出的像素。\n\n与“模型分辨率”不同，这不会让模型返回的结果变软：模型是在较小的\n画面上 1:1 运行，而不是在大画面上缩小运行，\n超分会把它的成果连同其他一切一起放大。\n\n尚未充分测试。此处的颜色每帧都带着不同的子像素抖动偏移，\n而模型无从得知，所以它的历史可能会按一个它看不到的偏移做重投影。\n请留意相机移动时精细细节上的闪烁和游移。" },
{ "Shows the pass against itself, so the two can be seen at once rather than\ntoggled and remembered.\n\nSide by side puts the whole frame in each half, untouched on the left and\nedited on the right. Both halves are squeezed horizontally to fit, so it is\nfor looking at rather than playing in.\n\nWipe cuts a single frame at the split and resamples nothing, so the picture\nis the right shape and can be played normally. Drag the split below; it is a\nstored setting and stays put once the menu is closed.\n\nNeither needs the menu open to keep working. A hairline marks the join.", "把这一步处理前后的画面放在一起，可以同时看到两者，\n而不用来回切换、靠记忆比较。\n\n“并排”在每一半里放入整幅画面，左边是未处理的，右边是编辑后的。\n两半都被水平压缩以适应宽度，所以是用来看的，不适合用来玩。\n\n“分屏”在分割线处切开同一帧，不做任何重采样，所以画面比例正确，\n可以正常游玩。拖动下面的“分割线”；它是会保存的设置，\n关闭菜单后位置不变。\n\n两者都不需要菜单开着才能继续工作。接缝处有一条细线标记。" },
{ "Side by side", "并排" },
{ "Silly goose detected", "检测到小笨蛋" },
{ "Similar to Lanczos2.\nSmoother and less prone to artefacts than Lanczos, but slightly blurrier.", "与 Lanczos2 类似。\n比 Lanczos 更平滑、更不容易出伪影，但略模糊一些。" },
{ "Similar to Lanczos3.\nFar less prone to artefacting than Lanczos3, but much heavier on the GPU.\nConsidered the best along with Lanczos3.", "与 Lanczos3 类似。\n远比 Lanczos3 不容易出伪影，但 GPU 负担重得多。\n与 Lanczos3 并列被认为是最好的。" },
{ "Similar to preset K. Preset J might exhibit slightly\nless ghosting...\n1st Gen Transformer", "与 Preset K 类似。Preset J 的鬼影可能\n略少一些...\n第一代 Transformer" },
