{ "Smoothness", "平滑度" },
{ "Smooths small frame-to-frame changes of the neural effect along motion\nvectors when available, after the runtime. Changes larger than the threshold\npass through, and the game's own image is untouched. 0 turns it off; higher values can\nsoften fine detail in motion. NR without upscaling defaults to 0.8 with optical flow.", "在运行时之后，沿运动矢量（如果有）平滑神经效果的帧间小幅变化。\n大于阈值的变化会直接通过，游戏自己的图像不受影响。\n0 为关闭；数值越高，运动中的精细细节可能越软。\n不带超分的 NR 配合光流时默认为 0.8。" },
{ "Smooths small frame-to-frame changes of the neural effect along the game's motion\nvectors, after the runtime and before the upscaler. Changes larger than the threshold\npass through, and the game's own image is untouched. 0 turns it off; higher values can\nsoften fine detail in motion.", "在运行时之后、超分之前，沿游戏的运动矢量平滑神经效果的帧间小幅变化。\n大于阈值的变化会直接通过，游戏自己的图像不受影响。\n0 为关闭；数值越高，运动中的精细细节可能越软。" },
{ "Soft edge", "柔和边缘" },
{ "Soft edge and strech fill the screen edges with the edge pixels,\nsoft edge blurs them more the further out it goes\nDither and noise use the unprojected image as fill\nand then some blending on the edges to fool the eye", "“柔和边缘”和“拉伸边缘”用边缘像素填充屏幕边缘，\n“柔和边缘”越往外模糊得越厉害\n“色彩抖动”和“噪声”则用未投影的图像来填充，\n再在边缘做一些混合来骗过眼睛" },
{ "Some NR processing still uses original wait.", "部分 NR 处理仍在使用原始等待。" },
{ "Some Unreal Engine games need this\n\nTry using if colours flickering or\nobjects have ghosting trails", "某些 Unreal Engine 游戏需要它\n\n如果颜色闪烁或物体有鬼影拖尾，\n可以试试" },
{ "Some of those pixels might even be real!", "这些像素里说不定还有真的！" },
{ "Spatial (no motion vectors)", "空间（无运动矢量）" },
{ "Specialised to prevent artifacts.\nEliminates harsh halos for a natural look, but can appear slightly soft.", "专门用于防止伪影。\n消除生硬的光晕，观感自然，但可能略显柔和。" },
{ "Specular Signal", "镜面反射信号" },
{ "Speed", "速度" },
{ "Splash", "Splash" },
{ "Split", "分割线" },
{ "Splits the upscaler in two and puts the model between the halves. The upscaler\nwrites at render resolution, the model runs on that, and the enlargement to\ndisplay resolution happens afterwards.\n\nWith ray reconstruction this makes the first half a denoiser and nothing else,\nwhich is the arrangement worth having: the frame the model sees is clean, and it\nis a quarter of the pixels at Performance.\n\nUnlike 'Run before the upscaler', the frame here has already been through\ntemporal accumulation, so the subpixel jitter the model cannot be told about is\nresolved before it sees anything.\n\nThe enlargement is the output scaler, not the upscaler's own. Takes effect when\nthe upscaler is next built, so restart or change quality after ticking it.\n\nDoes nothing when render resolution already equals display resolution -- at\nDLAA there is no smaller frame to run on.", "把超分一分为二，把模型放在两半之间。超分以渲染分辨率写出，\n模型在其上运行，放大到显示分辨率则在之后进行。\n\n配合光线重建时，前一半就只是个降噪器，这正是值得采用的安排：\n模型看到的画面是干净的，而且在“性能”档下只有四分之一的像素。\n\n与“在超分之前运行”不同，这里的画面已经经过时域累积，\n所以那个无法告知模型的子像素抖动，在模型看到画面之前\n就已经解决了。\n\n放大由输出缩放器完成，而不是超分自己的。在下次构建超分时生效，\n所以勾选后请重启或更改质量档。\n\n渲染分辨率已等于显示分辨率时不起作用 --\nDLAA 下没有更小的画面可供运行。" },
