{ "Such an aggressive upscaling? A bold move", "超分开这么猛？够大胆" },
{ "Supersampling %.2fx: the model runs ABOVE native, then\nis sampled back down. Experimental, and costly -- time grows with the area.", "超采样 %.2fx：模型以“高于”原生的分辨率运行，\n再采样缩小回来。实验性，开销很大 -- 耗时随面积增长。" },
