{ "Swapchain", "Swapchain" },
{ "Sync Int.", "同步间隔" },
{ "Syncing Settings", "同步设置" },
{ "Synthesises detail in the upscaler's frame, before frame generation sees it.\n\nNeeds two similarly named files beside OptiScaler, one character apart:\n  nvngx_dlssnr.dll       NVIDIA's model (~165 MB) -- you supply it\n  nvngx.dll_dlssnr.dll   the forwarder (~13 KB) -- ships in this package\nUndocumented and driven directly, so none of this is officially supported.", "在超分输出的画面中合成细节，在帧生成看到它之前。\n\n需要在 OptiScaler 旁边放两个名字相近、只差一个字符的文件：\n  nvngx_dlssnr.dll       NVIDIA 的模型（约 165 MB）-- 需自备\n  nvngx.dll_dlssnr.dll   转发器（约 13 KB）-- 本包自带\n没有文档、直接驱动，所以这些都没有官方支持。" },
{ "System", "系统" },
{ "Take the upscaler inputs from this API", "从此 API 获取超分输入" },
{ "Takes off the brightening the network adds in near-black areas, so blacks stay black.", "去掉网络在接近黑色区域加上的提亮，让黑色保持黑色。" },
{ "Takes the game's GBuffer.SpecularMvec for how reflections move, as DLSS-RR does,\ninstead of deriving it from depth, normals and the hit distance.\nDiagnostic: turn it off to see whether reflections smear or lag.", "像 DLSS-RR 那样，用游戏的 GBuffer.SpecularMvec 来确定反射如何运动，\n而不是从深度、法线和命中距离推导。\n诊断用：关掉它，看反射是否拖影或滞后。" },
{ "Takes the transparency layer's own opacity and motion vectors when the game gives them, as DLSS-RR does.\nDiagnostic: turn it off to see whether particles or transparent effects change.", "像 DLSS-RR 那样，在游戏提供时使用透明层自己的不透明度和运动矢量。\n诊断用：关掉它，看粒子或透明效果是否有变化。" },
{ "Target FPS", "目标 FPS" },
{ "Target FPS (rendered)", "目标 FPS（渲染）" },
{ "Teal", "青色" },
{ "Temporal", "时域" },
{ "Temporal HUD pin", "时域 HUD 固定" },
{ "Temporal Stability Bias", "时域稳定性偏置" },
{ "Temporal history", "时域历史" },
{ "Tested and approved by By-U", "经 By-U 测试并认可" },
{ "Thanks nitec, back to you nitec", "谢谢 nitec，交回给你，nitec" },
{ "That's likely unintended and will lead to big OptiScaler.log\nPlease disable logging to file and delete OptiScaler.log", "这多半不是有意的，会让 OptiScaler.log 变得很大\n请禁用写入文件的日志并删除 OptiScaler.log" },
{ "The FG that you will actually be using", "你实际会用到的 FG" },
{ "The GPU's own: AntiLag 2 on AMD, Reflex on Nvidia, LatencyFlex otherwise", "GPU 自带的：AMD 用 AntiLag 2，Nvidia 用 Reflex，其余用 LatencyFlex" },
{ "The GPU's own: AntiLag 2 on AMD, Reflex on Nvidia, XeLL on Intel, LatencyFlex otherwise", "GPU 自带的：AMD 用 AntiLag 2，Nvidia 用 Reflex，Intel 用 XeLL，其余用 LatencyFlex" },
{ "The GPU's own: AntiLag on AMD, Reflex on Nvidia, LatencyFlex otherwise", "GPU 自带的：AMD 用 AntiLag，Nvidia 用 Reflex，其余用 LatencyFlex" },
{ "The OpenNR installer on GitHub", "GitHub 上的 OpenNR 安装器" },
{ "The RX 6000 has neither FP8 nor matrix units, so this runs the RX 7000's FP16\nnetwork with its matrices worked out in ordinary FP16 dot products: much slower\nthan on an RX 9000 or RX 7000, and about 2 GB more VRAM at 1080p. Every pipeline\nwas compiled once apart from the game before the first build.\nExperimental: if the picture looks wrong or the game stutters, turn NR off and report it.", "RX 6000 既没有 FP8 也没有矩阵单元，所以这里运行的是 RX 7000 的 FP16 网络，\n矩阵用普通的 FP16 点积来计算：比在 RX 9000 或 RX 7000 上慢得多，\n1080p 下多用约 2 GB VRAM。首次构建之前，每个 pipeline 都已在\n游戏之外编译过一次。\n实验性：如果画面不对或游戏卡顿，请关闭 NR 并反馈。" },
{ "The RX 7000 has no FP8, so this runs mauri870's port of the network to FP16\nmatrices: slower than on an RX 9000, and about 2 GB more VRAM at 1080p. The GPU's\nmatrix layout and every pipeline were checked before the first build.\nExperimental: if the picture looks wrong, turn NR off and report it.", "RX 7000 没有 FP8，所以这里运行的是 mauri870 移植到 FP16 矩阵的网络：\n比在 RX 9000 上慢，1080p 下多用约 2 GB VRAM。首次构建之前\n已检查过 GPU 的矩阵布局和每个 pipeline。\n实验性：如果画面不对，请关闭 NR 并反馈。" },
{ "The Way It's Meant To Be Upscaled", "就该这么超分" },
{ "The best input the game sends: Reflex, XeLL when enabled in the game, AntiLag 2, UE, XeLL.\nAntiLag 2 first while the game's FSR-FG reports its frames through it.\nWithout any, OptiScaler's own with the DLSSG output.", "游戏发送的最佳输入：Reflex、在游戏中启用时的 XeLL、AntiLag 2、UE、XeLL。\n当游戏的 FSR-FG 通过 AntiLag 2 报告帧时，优先用 AntiLag 2。\n都没有时，配合 DLSSG 输出使用 OptiScaler 自己的。" },
{ "The current NGX parameter table cannot be safely enumerated.", "当前的 NGX 参数表无法安全枚举。" },
{ "The data source to be used for FG\nThe native FG which the game supports", "FG 使用的数据来源\n即游戏原生支持的 FG" },
{ "The display curve the network sees the frame through. Changing it\nrestarts the model's history.\n\nNeeds the danielblnc runtime 0.4.0 or later.", "网络观看画面时所经过的显示曲线。更改它\n会重置模型的历史。\n\n需要 danielblnc 运行时 0.4.0 或更高版本。" },
{ "The filter that averages the model's above-native answer back to display size --\nthis is what turns supersampling into LESS noise rather than more. Sharper\nfilters (Lanczos3, Kaiser3) keep the most detail; softer ones (Bicubic,\nCatmull-Rom) are gentler on ringing. Independent of the Output Scaling\ndownscaler, so the two can differ and run at the same time.", "把模型高于原生分辨率的结果平均回显示尺寸的滤波器 --\n正是它让超采样带来“更少”而不是更多的噪点。更锐利的滤波器\n（Lanczos3、Kaiser3）保留最多细节；更柔和的（Bicubic、\nCatmull-Rom）振铃更轻。它独立于“输出缩放”的降采样器，\n所以两者可以不同，也可以同时运行。" },
{ "The game doesn't send it", "游戏没有发送它" },
{ "The game's DLSS-FG is running; set it in the game", "游戏的 DLSS-FG 正在运行；请在游戏内设置" },
{ "The game's motion vectors (DXGI format %u) are not supported: running\nwithout history.", "不支持游戏的运动矢量（DXGI 格式 %u）：\n以无历史方式运行。" },
{ "The game's own exposure", "游戏自己的曝光" },
{ "The highest multiplier Dynamic MFG may use", "动态 MFG 可使用的最高倍率" },
{ "The illusion of performance", "性能的幻觉" },
{ "The largest colour change the composition lets through, in stops. The brightness change\nis held by the highlight guard.", "合成允许通过的最大颜色变化，单位为档（stop）。亮度变化\n由高光保护限制。" },
{ "The model is handed the finished frame, and the percentage below is of\nthat frame: at 50% a 4K picture is reduced to 1080p, the model runs on\nit, and its answer is enlarged back to fill the frame.", "交给模型的是最终画面，下面的百分比就是相对于它的：\n50% 时 4K 画面被缩小到 1080p，模型在其上运行，\n再把结果放大回去填满画面。" },
{ "The model is handed the render-resolution frame the upscaler is about to\nread, so the percentage below is of that render resolution. The upscaler\nthen enlarges the model\'s work along with everything else.", "交给模型的是超分即将读取的渲染分辨率画面，\n所以下面的百分比是相对于该渲染分辨率的。\n之后超分会把模型的成果连同其他一切一起放大。" },
{ "The model was trained on finished, sRGB-encoded frames. The upscaler's\noutput is not one: it is linear and open-ended. These decide how it is\nmapped into something the model recognises. A frame the game reports as\nalready tone-mapped is passed over untouched and none of this applies.", "模型是用 sRGB 编码的最终画面训练的。超分的输出并不是这样：\n它是线性的，而且没有上限。这些选项决定如何把它映射成\n模型认得的东西。游戏报告为已做过色调映射的画面\n会原样交出，这些都不适用。" },
{ "The model's own processing profiles. Standard is NVIDIA's default; Natural is\nthe one lmxxf's kernels had built in before. Changing it rebuilds the model,\na pause of a second or two.", "模型自己的处理配置。“标准”是 NVIDIA 的默认；“自然”是\nlmxxf 的内核以前内置的那个。更改它会重建模型，\n会停顿一两秒。" },
{ "The more you upscaler, the more you save", "超分越多，省得越多" },
{ "The most the composition may brighten or darken a pixel, as a multiple of what it was.\nOne number from the brightness, applied to the whole colour, so it bounds light without\ntouching hue. 2.0x by default; raise it only if bright areas look held back.", "合成最多能把一个像素提亮或压暗多少，以原值的倍数表示。\n由亮度得出一个数，应用到整个颜色上，所以它限制的是光的强弱，\n不影响色相。默认 2.0x；只有亮部看起来被压住时才调高。" },
{ "The most the pass may move any pixel, as a multiple of what it already was, in\nboth directions -- a pixel may not be brightened past this nor darkened past\nits reciprocal. Lights are where the model has least to say and rescaling its\nanswer does the most damage; 2x leaves detail intact while stopping a strip\nlight turning into a string of coloured cells. Raise it only if bright areas\nlook clipped.", "这一步最多能把任一像素改变多少，以原值的倍数表示，两个方向都算 --\n像素提亮不得超过它，压暗不得超过它的倒数。\n光源是模型最没什么可说的地方，重新缩放它的结果在这里破坏也最大；\n2x 能保住细节，同时防止灯带变成一串彩色格子。\n只有亮部看起来被截断时才调高。" },
{ "The network NR runs, by its name in NVIDIA's DLL, as mochizuki's NR Control lists them.\nCC_SMALL_FP8: the model of 310.9.16, the default and fastest.\nCC_SMALL_FP8_EXPERIMENTAL: that model made faster by mochizuki; its picture differs somewhat.\nCC_SILVER_AARDWOLD: the model of 310.8.\nCC_SILVER_AARDWOLD_OPTIMIZED: the 310.8 model made faster by mochizuki, its picture very close.\nThe two faster ones need ACO on an RX 9000; their weights are made from the installed model the\nfirst time. Switching builds the other network in a few seconds while the current one keeps\nrunning; no restart.", "NR 运行的网络，按它在 NVIDIA DLL 中的名字列出，与 mochizuki 的 NR Control 一致。\nCC_SMALL_FP8：310.9.16 的模型，默认且最快。\nCC_SMALL_FP8_EXPERIMENTAL：由 mochizuki 加速过的该模型；画面略有不同。\nCC_SILVER_AARDWOLD：310.8 的模型。\nCC_SILVER_AARDWOLD_OPTIMIZED：由 mochizuki 加速过的 310.8 模型，画面非常接近。\n两个更快的需要 RX 9000 上的 ACO；它们的权重在首次使用时由已安装的模型生成。\n切换时会在几秒内构建另一个网络，期间当前网络继续运行；\n无需重启。" },
{ "The network also reads its own result from the previous frame, moved along the\ngame's motion vectors. Keeps the effect steadier in motion. Off runs every frame\non its own.", "网络还会读取自己上一帧的结果，并沿游戏的运动矢量移动。\n让效果在运动中更稳定。关闭后每帧独立运行。" },
{ "The network runs on a smaller copy of the frame: full resolution in the centre, lower toward\nthe edges, and its change is put back on the full frame, so the game's own detail stays\neverywhere and only the effect gets softer at the sides. NR pixels at 16:9: about 80% light,\n70% medium, 45-50% strong. Each change rebuilds the network and restarts its history.\nBefore the upscaler it runs with mochizuki only (the render frame is warped, the upscaler\nkeeps its jitter); off while person protection runs.\nCustom takes FoveationCentreWidth/Height, FoveationFalloff and FoveationEdge from the INI.", "网络在一份较小的画面副本上运行：中心为全分辨率，越靠边缘越低，\n它的改动再放回完整画面，所以游戏自己的细节处处保留，\n只是效果在两侧变得柔和。16:9 下的 NR 像素数：“轻”约 80%，\n“中”70%，“强”45-50%。每次更改都会重建网络并重置其历史。\n在超分之前时只能配合 mochizuki 运行（渲染画面被扭曲，\n超分保留其抖动）；人物保护运行时关闭。\n“自定义”从 INI 读取 FoveationCentreWidth/Height、FoveationFalloff 和 FoveationEdge。" },
{ "The network's history in RGBA16F, as NVIDIA's DLL keeps it (half the memory). Off keeps\nRGBA32F, the picture before. An RX 9000 with ACO off keeps 32-bit. Rebuilds the network.", "网络的历史以 RGBA16F 保存，和 NVIDIA 的 DLL 一样（内存减半）。关闭则保持\nRGBA32F，即以前的画面。关闭 ACO 的 RX 9000 保持 32 位。会重建网络。" },
{ "The number runs the other way", "数值方向相反" },
{ "The resource inspector is off. Enable it in the FSR-RR page.", "资源检查器已关闭。请在 FSR-RR 页面启用它。" },
{ "The safest, but might not reduce latency well", "最安全，但降低延迟的效果可能不好" },
{ "The same frame twice: without OptiScaler's overlays, and as shown with the menu on it,\nnamed \"... (menu).png\".", "同一帧保存两份：一份不带 OptiScaler 的叠加层，一份是带菜单的显示效果，\n命名为 \"... (menu).png\"。" },
{ "The size YuNet sees the whole frame at. Larger finds smaller faces and costs more CPU time.\n320 by default.", "YuNet 观看整幅画面时所用的尺寸。越大越能找到更小的脸，CPU 耗时也更多。\n默认 320。" },
{ "The weight of the network's change. 0 is the game's own picture, 1 the change as the\nnetwork made it. Above 1 the brightness change is pushed further, still inside the\nhighlight guard, and the colour change stays as it was.", "网络改动的权重。0 是游戏自己的画面，1 是网络原本做出的改动。\n超过 1 时亮度变化会被进一步加强（仍在高光保护范围内），\n颜色变化则保持不变。" },
{ "The white point for the selected calibration point, or -- with no row\nselected -- the value the next Anchor press captures.\n\nSet it until the picture looks right here, then Anchor. Move to very\ndifferent light and do it again: two points fix the buffer's real\nrelationship and the white point holds between them. Click a row below\nto come back and adjust that point; click it again to let go.", "所选校准点的白点；没有选中任何行时，\n则是下次按锚点时会记录的值。\n\n调到这里的画面看起来合适，然后设锚点。走到差别很大的光照下\n再做一次：两个点就能确定缓冲区的真实关系，\n白点在两者之间保持准确。点击下面的某一行\n可以回来调整那个点；再点一次则放开。" },
{ "The whole pass: the staging copies and the resolve as well as the\nmodel. Timing only the model would flatter the number.\n\nCompare it against the frame time at the bottom of this window to\nsee what it is costing you.", "整个处理步骤：除了模型，还包括暂存拷贝和 resolve。\n只给模型计时会让数字显得更好看。\n\n把它和本窗口底部的帧时间比一比，\n就知道它花了你多少开销。" },
{ "These hints are passed to NVIDIA at creation, but their visual effect is unverified. Use Style for model profile selection. Existing INI hints are preserved.", "这些提示会在创建时传给 NVIDIA，但它们的视觉效果未经验证。选择模型配置请用“风格”。INI 中已有的提示会保留。" },
{ "This MochizukiNrRuntime.dll runs the network outside the RenoDX\nstage, so the settings above do not reach it: update it.", "这个 MochizukiNrRuntime.dll 在 RenoDX 阶段之外运行网络，\n所以上面的设置对它无效：请更新它。" },
{ "This OpenRR runtime does not have the New mode.", "这个 OpenRR 运行时没有“新版”模式。" },
{ "This game has an upscaler, and NR runs inside it. NR without upscaling still sets XeFG's\nmotion vector options for frame generation; turn it off for this game.", "这个游戏有超分，NR 在其内部运行。“不带超分的 NR”仍会为帧生成设置\nXeFG 的运动矢量选项；请为这个游戏关闭它。" },
{ "This game supplies an exposure -- the option above would use it.", "这个游戏提供了曝光 -- 上面的选项会使用它。" },
{ "This game supplies an exposure and it is being read.", "这个游戏提供了曝光，并且正在读取。" },
{ "This game supplies no exposure -- paper white is in use. Try the scan instead.", "这个游戏没有提供曝光 -- 正在使用纸白。可以改试扫描。" },
