{ "Use generic appid with NGX\nFixes OptiScaler preset override not working with certain games\nRequires a game restart", "NGX 使用通用 appid\n修复 OptiScaler 预设覆盖在某些游戏中不起作用的问题\n需要重启游戏" },
{ "Use height difference as offset", "把高度差用作偏移" },
{ "Use if FSR4-FG is supported, otherwise stick to Enabler\n\nFFX used for the middle fake frame, Enabler for the rest\n\n2x - FFX\n3x - Enabler\n4x - FFX + Enabler\n5x - Enabler\n6x - FFX + Enabler\n\nDue to pacing, only odd number of fake frames are able to use FFX", "支持 FSR4-FG 时使用，否则请继续用 Enabler\n\n中间那一个假帧用 FFX，其余用 Enabler\n\n2x - FFX\n3x - Enabler\n4x - FFX + Enabler\n5x - Enabler\n6x - FFX + Enabler\n\n受帧步调限制，只有假帧数为奇数时才能使用 FFX" },
