{ "Waiting for the upscaler to run.", "正在等待超分运行。" },
{ "Walk from shade into daylight. A real exposure moves.", "从阴影走到日光下。真正的曝光值会变化。" },
{ "Warning", "警告" },
{ "Watching %u, none moving yet -- go between light and shade.", "正在观察 %u 个，还没有变化的 -- 请在亮处和阴影间走动。" },
{ "Watermark", "水印" },
{ "We don't need real pixels where we're going", "我们要去的地方不需要真像素" },
{ "Weights: %s", "权重：%s" },
{ "What backend to use instead of the real DLSSG", "用哪个后端来代替真 DLSSG" },
{ "What each pass is told, where it should differ from the values above.\n\nA control left on \"global\" follows the setting above it, so a pass you\nhave not touched behaves exactly as it did before this existed.\n\nThe passes compound: a later pass sees what the one before it produced.\nEasing intensity down the chain keeps the last passes refining rather than\nre-amplifying what is already there.", "每一遍被告知的参数，用于需要与上面的数值不同的地方。\n\n保持为 \"全局\" 的控件跟随它上方的设置，所以你没动过的遍\n表现与这个功能出现之前完全一样。\n\n各遍会叠加：后一遍看到的是前一遍产生的结果。\n沿着链条逐步降低强度，可以让最后几遍是在精修，\n而不是把已有的东西再放大一次。" },
{ "What enlarges the frame once the model has edited it.\n\nSpatial needs no motion vectors, no depth and no jitter, so it cannot be\nwrong about any of them -- and it is the softest, having nothing temporal to\nwork from.\n\nThe upscalers are sharper and use the game's own per-frame data. An\nupscaler this machine cannot run is replaced with one it can, the same way\nthe main upscaler list behaves.\n\nTakes effect when the upscaler is next built.", "模型编辑完画面后，由什么来放大它。\n\n“空间”不需要运动矢量、深度和抖动，所以在这些方面不会出错 --\n但它也是最软的，因为没有任何时域信息可用。\n\n各个超分更锐利，并使用游戏自己的逐帧数据。这台机器跑不了的超分\n会被换成能跑的，和主超分列表的行为一样。\n\n在下次构建超分时生效。" },
{ "What fraction of the frame the model works at. Cost falls with the square of\nthis, so half resolution is roughly a quarter of the time.\n\nThe frame is never reduced. Only the model's contribution is computed small\nand enlarged, so the picture underneath is untouched whatever this says.\n\nWhat it trades: the shading the model adds is broad and survives enlargement;\nthe fine structure it synthesises does not, and softens. Worth having when the\npass costs more than you want to pay for the detail it returns.\n\nThe frame itself stays at full detail whatever this says -- only the\nmodel's own work is done small.", "模型以画面的几分之几来工作。开销按它的平方下降，\n所以一半分辨率大约只要四分之一的时间。\n\n画面本身从不缩小。只有模型的贡献是以小尺寸计算再放大的，\n所以不管这里怎么设，底下的画面都不受影响。\n\n代价是：模型添加的明暗是大范围的，放大后还在；\n它合成的精细结构则保不住，会变软。当这一步的开销\n超过你愿意为它带回的细节付出的代价时，值得一用。\n\n不管这里怎么设，画面本身都保持完整细节 --\n只有模型自己的工作是以小尺寸完成的。" },
{ "What the NR reads, D3D12 backend.\nDenoised: the network's image before its temporal post; the change is kept with RR's own\nvectors and gates.\nOutput: RR's finished picture at the render size, without jitter; the change goes back on\nthat picture with a history on OptiScaler's side.", "NR 读取的内容，D3D12 后端。\n降噪后：网络在时域后处理之前的图像；改动用 RR 自己的矢量和门控来保持。\n输出：RR 在渲染尺寸下的成品画面，不带抖动；改动放回这幅画面上，\n历史保存在 OptiScaler 一侧。" },
{ "What the frame is divided by before the model sees it. There is no other white\npoint; this is the whole of it.\n\nThe model was trained on finished frames where white sits at 1. The\nupscaler's output is linear and open-ended, so something has to say where\nwhite is -- and where the game's DLSS buffer is linear HDR, that number is\nrarely anywhere near 1. Measured in Monster Hunter Wilds it takes 16 or more\nbefore the model's detail reaches the frame at all, and the value that suits\na shaded camp is still too small for the same game out in daylight.\n\nToo low and almost every pixel trips the soft knee: the model is shown a\nflat near-white picture, its answer is scaled away, and only its hue\nsurvives -- which reads as a colour cast rather than as lost detail. Too\nhigh and it is shown an underexposed one, its answer degrades, and this same\nnumber multiplies that error on the way out.\n\nRaise it until the picture stops improving. Past that point it does not\nplateau, it gets worse in the other direction.\n\nThis was once a multiplier on a measured white point. The measurement is\ngone: it read scene brightness rather than where white belongs, handed the\nmodel a picture three times too dark, and left the highlight path nothing to\ngive back.\n\nAt strength zero the frame is still bit-identical whatever this says.", "模型看到画面之前，画面要除以的数值。没有别的白点；\n它就是全部。\n\n模型是用白色位于 1 的最终画面训练的。超分的输出是线性的、\n没有上限，所以必须有个东西指明白色在哪里 --\n而当游戏的 DLSS 缓冲是线性 HDR 时，这个数很少接近 1。\n在 Monster Hunter Wilds 中实测，要到 16 或更高，模型的细节\n才会出现在画面上，而适合阴凉营地的数值，\n放到同一游戏的日光下仍然太小。\n\n太低时几乎每个像素都会触发软拐点：模型看到的是一幅\n平坦、接近全白的画面，它的结果被缩放掉，只剩下色相 --\n看起来像是偏色，而不是丢了细节。太高时模型看到的是\n曝光不足的画面，它的结果变差，而输出时\n这同一个数又会把误差放大。\n\n把它调高，直到画面不再变好。过了那个点它不会持平，\n而是朝另一个方向变差。\n\n它曾经是一个测得白点上的乘数。那个测量已经去掉了：\n它读的是场景亮度，而不是白色该在的位置，\n交给模型的画面暗了三倍，也让高光路径无可归还。\n\n强度为零时，不管这里怎么设，画面仍然逐位一致。" },
{ "What the model is shown, and how its answer comes back.\n\nOff (soft knee): the default. It rolls highlights off so hard the model\ncannot resolve detail in them -- fine in soft-lit scenes, weak in bright ones.\n\nNeutwo composed: an unclipped curve so the model sees highlight detail, then\neverything above (Detail/Colour strength, highlight guard, palette). It wins in\nbright scenes, but the curve compresses MIDTONES too, so in soft-lit content it\ncan be worse than Off. It also shifts paper white -- re-check it when you switch.\n\nHybrid composed: the best of both, and the one to use. Identity in the\nmidtones -- as good as Off there -- and the unclipped roll only in the\nhighlights, so it recovers the detail Off crushes without giving up the\nmidtones Neutwo does. It barely shifts paper white.\n\nReplace: the raw model straight back through the exact inverse, none of the\ncomposition -- no guard, no palette, no strengths. Gorgeous where there are no\nbright lights, but they FLASH in motion. A reference, not a daily setting.\n\nHybrid replace: the raw model like Replace, but on the hybrid curve -- the\ndecode is identity in the midtones, so the flashing is confined to genuine\nbright highlights instead of everywhere. Most of Replace's detail, far more\nstable. If you love the Replace look but the flicker bothers you, use this.\n\nOff is byte-identical to before.", "给模型看什么，以及它的结果如何返回。\n\n关闭（软拐点）：默认。它把高光滚降得太狠，模型无法分辨\n其中的细节 -- 柔光场景没问题，明亮场景较弱。\n\nNeutwo 合成：一条不截断的曲线，让模型能看到高光细节，之后经过上面的\n所有处理（细节/颜色强度、高光保护、调色板）。在明亮场景中胜出，\n但这条曲线也会压缩“中间调”，所以在柔光内容中可能不如“关闭”。\n它还会让纸白偏移 -- 切换后请重新检查。\n\n混合合成：兼得两者之长，推荐使用。中间调保持恒等 -- 那里和“关闭”\n一样好 -- 只在高光使用不截断的滚降，\n所以既能找回被“关闭”压掉的细节，又不像 Neutwo 那样牺牲中间调。\n它几乎不会让纸白偏移。\n\n替换：原始模型输出直接经精确逆变换返回，不经过任何合成 --\n没有保护，没有调色板，没有强度。没有强光的地方非常漂亮，\n但强光在运动中会“闪”。作参考用，不适合日常使用。\n\n混合替换：和“替换”一样用原始模型输出，但走混合曲线 --\n解码在中间调保持恒等，所以闪烁只出现在真正的亮高光上，\n而不是到处都是。保留了“替换”的大部分细节，稳定得多。\n如果你喜欢“替换”的观感但受不了闪烁，就用这个。\n\n“关闭”与以前逐字节一致。" },
{ "What the model sees", "模型看到的画面" },
{ "Whatever the game uses", "跟随游戏所用的" },
{ "When enabled, RR denoises and upscales first; NR then processes its output\nbefore frame generation. When disabled with 'Run NR before Super Resolution'\nenabled, NR processes the render-resolution Color input before RR.\nThis does not add RR to games without the required rendering buffers.\nIndependent controls below prevent inheriting the cost of the SR configuration.\nNative Vulkan does not use these DX12 controls.", "启用时，RR 先降噪并超分；然后 NR 在帧生成之前处理它的输出。\n禁用且启用了“在超分辨率之前应用”时，\nNR 在 RR 之前处理渲染分辨率的 Color 输入。\n这不会给缺少所需渲染缓冲的游戏加上 RR。\n下面的独立控件可避免继承 SR 配置的开销。\n原生 Vulkan 不使用这些 DX12 控件。" },
{ "Where FPS may land, as multipliers only come in steps:\nat most, around or at least the target FPS.", "FPS 可能落在哪里（因为倍率只能按级变化）：\n不高于、接近或不低于目标 FPS。" },
{ "Where the number that divides the frame comes from.\n\nPaper white only -- the slider below and nothing else. Right for a\ngame whose exposure never moves, wrong the moment it does: one\nconstant cannot serve a cave and a field.\n\nThe game's own exposure -- read from the texture the game hands\nthe upscaler. The best source there is, because it is decided\nupstream and nothing this pass does can move it. Not every game\nsupplies one.\n\nA buffer the scan found -- for games that compute an exposure and\nnever pass it on. A GUESS: candidates are matched by shape, and in\nGTA V the best one tracks the real exposure but at its own scale,\nwhich the anchor's ratio cancels. Needs anchoring once, and checking\nafterwards.", "用来除画面的那个数从哪里来。\n\n仅纸白 -- 只用下面的滑块，别无其他。适合曝光从不变化的游戏，\n一旦曝光变化就不对了：一个常数无法同时\n适用于洞穴和旷野。\n\n游戏自己的曝光 -- 从游戏交给超分的纹理中读取。\n这是最好的来源，因为它是在上游决定的，\n这一步做什么都改变不了它。并非每个游戏都提供。\n\n扫描找到的缓冲区 -- 用于计算了曝光却从不传出来的游戏。\n这是“猜测”：候选项按形状匹配，在 GTA V 中最好的那个\n能跟踪真实曝光，但用的是它自己的尺度，\n锚点的比值会把这个尺度抵消掉。需要设一次锚点，\n之后还要检查。" },
{ "Where the picture has not changed, reuses part of the model's previous work instead of\nrunning it again: a few fps more when the camera stands still, nothing in motion.\nSlightly lossy. Works with one pass only.", "画面没有变化的地方，复用模型上一次的部分成果，而不是重新运行：\n相机静止时多几 fps，运动时没有提升。\n略有损失。只在一遍时可用。" },
{ "Where the result differs little from the previous frame's, blends it toward that frame.\nTakes out the small flicker the model leaves from frame to frame; real changes pass\nthrough. 0 turns it off. Higher values can leave a short trail.\nWith \"Smooth the effect only\" it acts on the model's change alone.", "结果与上一帧差别很小的地方，把它向上一帧混合。\n消除模型在帧与帧之间留下的细小闪烁；真实的变化会直接通过。\n0 为关闭。数值较高时可能留下短拖尾。\n开启 \"只平滑效果\" 时，它只作用于模型的改动。" },
{ "Where the title's per-pixel responsivity hint crosses this\nvalue, the pixel's specular radiance is published through the\nspatial path instead of being denoised temporally - the same\nexit the removed motion test used, driven by the title's own\nstatement instead of a measurement. 0 (the default) disables\nthe test. Check the InResponsivityMask view is not black\nbefore trusting a threshold; the probe prints the field's\npolarity.", "当游戏的逐像素响应度提示越过这个值时，\n该像素的镜面辐射亮度会通过空间路径输出，\n而不做时域降噪 - 与已移除的运动测试走的是同一个出口，\n只是由游戏自己的声明而不是测量来驱动。\n0（默认）禁用该测试。在相信某个阈值之前，\n请确认 InResponsivityMask 视图不是全黑的；\n探针会打印该数据的极性。" },
{ "Where the wipe cuts. Left of it is the frame as the upscaler produced it,\nright of it is the frame the model edited.", "分屏的切割位置。左边是超分输出的原画面，\n右边是模型编辑过的画面。" },
{ "Whether the model's colour arrives with its light.\n\n0 keeps the game's own hue exactly -- every pixel is the original colour with\nonly its brightness carrying the model's verdict. Game-accurate colour, with\nthe detail. 1 brings the model's colour as well, in its own hue, clamped into\nAP1 so nothing unreachable is asked for.\n\nThis cannot shift hue on its own: it interpolates between two finished\npictures rather than adding a colour difference to one, which is what used to\nlet a warm subject come back green.\n\nAbove 1 it OVER-SATURATES: the colour keeps its hue but grows more vivid,\nand rolls off at the edge of what the display can show rather than clipping\ninto a flat blown patch. 1 is the model's own colour; push past it for punch.", "模型的颜色是否随它的光照一起到达画面。\n\n0 完全保留游戏自己的色相 -- 每个像素都是原来的颜色，\n只有亮度体现模型的判断。颜色忠于游戏，同时带有细节。\n1 则把模型的颜色也带上，用它自己的色相，并钳制在 AP1 内，\n以免要求无法达到的颜色。\n\n它本身不会造成色相偏移：它是在两幅成品画面之间插值，\n而不是往其中一幅上加颜色差值，\n以前暖色主体变绿就是后者造成的。\n\n超过 1 时会“过饱和”：颜色保持色相但更鲜艳，\n到显示器能显示的极限处会平滑滚降，而不是截断成\n一块过曝的平色。1 是模型自己的颜色；想更有冲击力就再往上推。" },
{ "Whether the model's edit is applied. Off shows the clean upscaler frame while the\npass keeps running -- so with Hold frame (under Compare) you can freeze a\nframe and toggle this to see the same frozen frame with and without Neural\nRendering. Leave it on for normal use.", "是否应用模型的编辑。关闭时显示干净的超分画面，而处理仍在运行 --\n所以配合“定格”（在“对比”下）可以冻结一帧，\n再切换此项，查看同一帧有无 Neural Rendering 的效果。\n正常使用请保持开启。" },
{ "Which copium do you choose?", "你选哪种 copium？" },
{ "Which side of the threshold counts as unstable. Whether a\ntitle writes responsive as 0 or as 1 is its own property,\nnot something this code can know. Inert while the threshold\nis 0.", "阈值的哪一侧算作不稳定。游戏把“响应”写成 0 还是 1\n是它自己的特性，这段代码无从得知。\n阈值为 0 时不起作用。" },
{ "White point from", "白点来源" },
{ "Who's Nukem anyway?", "话说 Nukem 到底是谁？" },
{ "Will be applied after RESOLUTION/PRESET change !!!", "更改“分辨率/预设”之后才会生效 !!!" },
{ "Will might be applied after RESOLUTION/PRESET change !!!", "可能要更改“分辨率/预设”之后才会生效 !!!" },
{ "Will use more VRAM, but Uniscaler needs this\nMaybe some other games might need too", "会占用更多 VRAM，但 Uniscaler 需要它\n其他一些游戏可能也需要" },
{ "Will use more VRAM, but some games might need this", "会占用更多 VRAM，但有些游戏可能需要它" },
{ "Wipe", "分屏" },
{ "With NR without upscaling, OptiFG runs on XeFG or DLSSG only", "使用不带超分的 NR 时，OptiFG 只能在 XeFG 或 DLSSG 上运行" },
{ "With an upscaler the frame NR sees moves by a fraction of a pixel every frame (the\ncamera jitter), which the game's motion vectors leave out. On, the history is\nfetched where the last frame's sample really was: finer detail may hold steadier.\nNeeds Temporal history. No effect without an upscaler.", "有超分时，NR 看到的画面每帧都会移动不到一个像素（相机抖动），\n而游戏的运动矢量不包含这部分。开启后，历史会从上一帧采样\n真正所在的位置读取：精细细节可能更稳。\n需要“时域历史”。没有超分时无效。" },
{ "With an upscaler, on a native D3D12 game. Without one, NR without upscaling above is At\nPresent. The D3D11, Vulkan and D3D9 routes run before the upscaler.\nBefore: on the render resolution frame, the game's motion vectors; cheapest, the upscaler\nthen sees NR's picture. The default.\nAfter: on the upscaler's or Ray Reconstruction's output, at display resolution, so it\ncosts more; the game's motion vectors. Keeps the upscaler's detail.\nAt Present: on the finished picture before frame generation, HUD included, at display\nresolution; motion from optical flow, SDR back buffers only. With frame generation's\nHUD fix the generated frames may not carry NR.\nThe stabilizer, foveated NR and person protection need Before.", "适用于有超分的原生 D3D12 游戏。没有超分时，上面的“不带超分的 NR”相当于\n“Present 时”。D3D11、Vulkan 和 D3D9 方式在超分之前运行。\n之前：作用于渲染分辨率的画面，使用游戏的运动矢量；开销最低，\n之后超分看到的是 NR 的画面。默认值。\n之后：作用于超分或光线重建的输出，为显示分辨率，所以开销更大；\n使用游戏的运动矢量。保留超分的细节。\nPresent 时：作用于帧生成之前的最终画面，包含 HUD，为显示分辨率；\n运动来自光流，仅限 SDR 后备缓冲。使用帧生成的 HUD fix 时，\n生成帧可能不带 NR。\n稳定器、注视点 NR 和人物保护需要“之前”。" },
{ "With three passes, runs two and works out the third from the change between them:\nabout a third less GPU time, close to a real third pass.", "三遍时，只运行两遍，第三遍根据前两遍之间的变化推算：\nGPU 时间少约三分之一，效果接近真正的第三遍。" },
{ "With two or three passes, skin-coloured areas keep the first pass's result, so faces\ndo not take the extra passes. It goes by colour, not by faces: brown and orange\nsurfaces such as earth, wood or warm shadows are protected too.", "两遍或三遍时，肤色区域保留第一遍的结果，所以脸部不会经过额外的遍。\n它按颜色判断，而不是按人脸：泥土、木头或暖色阴影等\n棕色和橙色表面也会被保护。" },
{ "Worst case just turn it off and on", "大不了关掉再打开" },
{ "Write age", "写入帧龄" },
